scenario = "Given the application built against the rehearsal node, when the trading round trip of feature 6 runs (deposit, order, cancel, fill display, position management, funding display, withdrawal), then every chain call resolves to an address of contracts/address-table.md and the round trip completes; the completion gate is task 6.3.99."
