do_2 = "Module accounts: add spot to maccPerms (node/app.go:282-300) with {authtypes.Minter, authtypes.Burner}, the spot keeper refusing any mint or burn outside spot/share/* denoms, and spot to allowedReceivingModAcc (node/app.go:304-306) so BlockedAddrs (node/app.go:3465) does not block sends of uhpx and SID to it; add no entry for perps, launchpad or pricefeed (the rule of node/app.go:296-299) and no mint right for USDL, which the venues move as the existing ERC20 by transferFrom and transfer through CallEVM."
do_3 = "Precompiles: after GetCustomPrecompiles at node/app.go:962 register 0x1015 through exchangeVersionSwitch(perps NewPrecompile, layerxexchange NewPrecompile, false), 0x1017 through launchpadVersionSwitch(G2, legacy/v610, false), precompiles/pricefeed NewPrecompile at 0x1020 and each entry of precompiles/spot NewPrecompileSet, returning its error from the constructor; pass {activationPrecompileGate(), v6120PrecompileGate()} at node/app.go:963; replace setXWebPrecompile(false) at node/app.go:964 and the bodies of setXWebPrecompile and RefreshPrecompiles (node/upgrades.go:271-282) with the v6120PrecompileSet path keyed by app.xwebLive and app.v6120Live; after LoadLatestVersion beside refreshXWebPrecompile (node/app.go:1188) and in InitChainer (node/app.go:1466) set app.v6120Live from v6120LiveInState(ctx); return gigaV6120FailFast from gigaCustomPrecompiles (node/app.go:2564-2569) at the late height."
do_4 = "Hooks: add bindV6120Hooks in node/upgrades_v6120.go, called from the application constructor, setting v6120HookTable to pointers createV6120Pointers (task 1.2.4), modules/launchpad/keeper MigrateV6120 with the EVM keeper as EVMReader, modules/pricefeed/keeper InitV6120, modules/perps/keeper SeedV6120 and modules/spot/keeper InitV6120; the handler ends with setV6120Live(true) as written by task 1.0.3, and nothing in the handler calls RefreshPrecompiles or reads a done height."
do_5 = "End block: set PerpsKeeper, SpotKeeper and V6120Live: func() bool { return app.v6120Live } in the EndBlockKeepers literal (node/app.go:1017)."
do_6 = "Gasless: change IsTxGasless (node/antedecorators/gasless.go:73-104) to take pricefeedkeeper.Keeper after the EVM keeper and add case *pricefeedtypes.MsgSubmitPrices for a one-message tx dispatching pricefeed.SubmissionIsGasless; pass app.PricefeedKeeper at node/app.go:1704, node/app.go:1978 and node/app.go:3312, node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:85, node/ante/cosmos_delivertx.go:37, the GaslessDecorator (node/antedecorators/gasless.go:24-33, constructed at node/ante.go:80 with a PricefeedKeeper field of HandlerOptions), FeeFloor (node/sequencer/fee.go:36, node/sequencer/fee.go:71, its callers node/sequencer/fee_test.go:83 and rpc/pending_block_test.go:76) and blockGas (node/sequencer/layers.go:291); add MsgSubmitPrices to couldBeGaslessTransaction (node/app.go:3403), the sequencer couldBeGasless (node/sequencer/layers.go:329) and isExpectedGaslessMetricsError (node/app.go:3387) for LXP_PRICEFEED_RATE_LIMITED; update the IsTxGasless and NewGaslessDecorator calls of node/antedecorators/gasless_test.go and node/antedecorators/priority_test.go."
do_7 = "Check and deliver: add PricefeedKeeper to CheckTxKeepers (node/legacyabci/check_tx.go:32-41) and DeliverTxKeepers (node/legacyabci/deliver_tx.go:28-36), set in their literals (node/app.go:1023-1040), and pass it from node/legacyabci/check_tx.go:109 and node/legacyabci/deliver_tx.go:111 into CosmosCheckTxAnte (node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:62) and CosmosDeliverTxAnte (node/ante/cosmos_delivertx.go:16), which call pricefeed.CheckSubmission right after IsTxGasless; CosmosStatelessChecks (node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:136, beside the vote alone rule at node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:159-175) calls types.CheckSubmissionAlone; CheckMessage (node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:537) calls pricefeed.MarkSubmission outside ReCheckTx."
do_8 = "Priority: isOracleTx of node/prioritizer.go:185 and of node/antedecorators/priority.go:45, the DecoratePriority call at node/ante/cosmos_checktx.go:118 (oracleVote || types.IsSubmissionTx(tx)) and IsTxPrioritized (utils/prioritized_txs.go:9, read by rpc/simulate.go:504, rpc/simulate.go:625 and rpc/simulate.go:683) treat types.IsSubmissionTx as an oracle tx."
do_9 = "Tests in node/upgrades_v6120_test.go: TestV6120ModulesAreWired (module lists, SetOrderMidBlockers, keepers, five bound hooks), TestV6120ServesTheNewSetFromTheHandler, TestV6120ModuleAccounts, TestV6120EndBlockOrder (stores unmounted at H1-1 with no venue call and no panic; order perps, spot, EVM once live) and TestV6120AppliesThePlanOnTheHaltExport (seedV6120FromExport, document for H+1, previous proposer as node/upgrades_activation_test.go:308, BeginBlock at H+1 (node/abci.go:59), done height, hook effects, 0x1015 perps and 0x1017 G2 versions, 0x1020-0x1025 served, 0x1026 and 0x1027 without code, bridge mint authority, then a call to 0x1015 executed at H+2 in the same process with the giga executor enabled returning the perps result); task 5.3.3 proves the live price path on the wired node."
do_10 = "Open spec/layerx-merge tasks edit the same files and land first: node/app.go 1.6.4, 2.5.13, 2.6.3, 4.5.1, 5.6.8, 0.118, 0.143 (in progress), 9.1.2, 9.2.3, 9.6.1 (in progress), 10.6.1 (in progress) and 11.7.43; node/upgrades.go 2.5.13, 4.5.1 and 10.6.1; this task rebases onto their result before its gate."
do_11 = "The verify_cmd also runs the existing TestKVStoreKeyNamesMatchMemIAVLStoreKeys (node/store_keys_test.go:15), which passes with the perps, spot and pricefeed store names of task 1.3.102 in both kvStoreKeyNames and MemIAVLStoreKeys (req 1.8 ac_4)."
do_12 = "Open spec/layerx-merge task 13.7.4 edits node/upgrades.go; land after it and rebase onto its result."
do_13 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
