ac_27 = "`totalSupply()` (selector 0x18160ddd, view, returns `(uint256)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC721Enumerable.sol:24 is served at the fee-right collection 0xe8Dc…409B (Launch-x:shared/config/deployment/current.json:58), which holds the fee rights of every generation, and returns the value the contract returned at the halt height for migrated state and the value of the launchpad keeper state afterwards, with identical ABI encoding."
ac_28 = "`transferFrom(address,address,uint256)` (selector 0x23b872dd, nonpayable, returns `()`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC721Base.sol:72 is served at the fee-right collection 0xe8Dc…409B (Launch-x:shared/config/deployment/current.json:58), which holds the fee rights of every generation, with the contract behaviour of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC721Base.sol:72: same preconditions, same state effects in the launchpad keeper, same return encoding, same logs and the same custom-error revert data."
ac_29 = "Fee-right mint at market creation (operator 0x3993…8830 (Launch-x:shared/config/deployment/current.json:37)) and safeTransferFrom at the collection call onERC721Received on a contract receiver through a nested call, accept only the selector 0x150b7a02, give NonERC721Receiver() (0x80526d0c) for any other return value or an empty revert, and return any other revert data unchanged (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/core/SidioraNFT.sol:70-77, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC721Base.sol:81-92); MigrateV6120 imports fee rights into the store without calling the hook."

[req.2012]
title = "Pool tokens stay the deployed SidioraERC20 contracts at their addresses"
ac_1 = "`DOMAIN_SEPARATOR()` (selector 0x3644e515, view, returns `(bytes32)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:48 is served unchanged by the SidioraERC20 contract at every pool-token address: code and storage stay as at the halt height (requirement 2.24) and the precompile reaches the token only by nested calls."
ac_2 = "`PERMIT_TYPEHASH()` (selector 0x30adf81f, view, returns `(bytes32)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:26 is served unchanged by the SidioraERC20 contract at every pool-token address: code and storage stay as at the halt height (requirement 2.24) and the precompile reaches the token only by nested calls."
ac_3 = "`allowance(address,address)` (selector 0xdd62ed3e, view, returns `(uint256)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:14 is served unchanged by the SidioraERC20 contract at every pool-token address: code and storage stay as at the halt height (requirement 2.24) and the precompile reaches the token only by nested calls; the allowance that pulls by the Router and Factory surfaces spend is the one granted to 0x1017 (requirement 2.18)."
