ac_5 = "`balanceOf(address)` (selector 0x70a08231, view, returns `(uint256)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:13 is served unchanged by the SidioraERC20 contract at every pool-token address: code and storage stay as at the halt height (requirement 2.24) and the precompile reaches the token only by nested calls."
ac_6 = "`bindPool(address)` (selector 0x5a73fae2, nonpayable, returns `()`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/core/SidioraERC20.sol:21 is served unchanged by the SidioraERC20 contract at every pool-token address: code and storage stay as at the halt height (requirement 2.24) and the precompile reaches the token only by nested calls; it is called once with caller 0x3993…8830 (Launch-x:shared/config/deployment/current.json:37) for each market created after the upgrade, and reverts InvalidPoolBinding() for every migrated token, whose pool is already bound (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/core/SidioraERC20.sol:21-24)."
