ac_4 = "Custom error `AlreadyMinted()` (selector 0xddefae28, declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC721Base.sol:20) is the revert data of the precompile for the same condition in SidioraNFT; the precompile returns it as EVM revert data, not as a string reason, and the keeper error that carries it keeps its LXP_LAUNCHPAD_ code (modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7)."
