ac_6 = "Custom error `DeadlineExpired()` (selector 0x1ab7da6b, declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/interfaces/ISidioraPool.sol:8) is the revert data of the precompile for the same condition in SidioraPool, Router; the precompile returns it as EVM revert data, not as a string reason, and the keeper error that carries it keeps its LXP_LAUNCHPAD_ code (modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7)."
