ac_9 = "Custom error `DuplicateToken()` (selector 0x464e3f6a, declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/interfaces/ISidioraFactory.sol:10) is the revert data of the precompile for the same condition in SidioraFactory, PoolRegistry; the precompile returns it as EVM revert data, not as a string reason, and the keeper error that carries it keeps its LXP_LAUNCHPAD_ code (modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7)."
ac_10 = "Custom error `FeeOutOfRange()` (selector 0x0c8249ad, declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/interfaces/IProtocolConfig.sol:8) is the revert data of the precompile for the same condition in ProtocolConfig; the precompile returns it as EVM revert data, not as a string reason, and the keeper error that carries it keeps its LXP_LAUNCHPAD_ code (modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7)."
ac_11 = "Custom error `FutureLookup()` (selector 0x0297ecc2, declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:25) is raised by the pool-token contract itself, unchanged after the upgrade; a TransferHelper call of a surface wraps it as TransferFromFailed() or TransferFailed() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/libraries/TransferHelper.sol:8-9) and a direct interface call returns it unchanged as revert data."
