do_2 = "Keep the distinct function, event and custom-error counts of contracts/launchpad.md section 2 for each file: SidioraPool 42/6/19, SidioraFactory 23/6/16, SidioraERC20 19/2/7; an artifact that lists one error twice keeps the duplicate, and the counts are of distinct signatures."
do_3 = "Add TestCoreRoleABIFiles in precompiles/launchpad/abi_core_test.go parsing the three files with abi.JSON and asserting the distinct counts (symbol TestCoreRoleABIFiles)."
do_4 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
