[feature.3]
name = "perps"
scope = "The perpetuals venue of Paxeer X Network as a clean Go rewrite: the new modules/perps module with cross-margin accounts over the USDL ERC20 held by the perps module EVM address, a price-time priority book per market, tiered fees, the pricefeed-based mark price, hourly lazy funding, per-side open-interest caps, account-level liquidation through a maintained margin-ratio index, insurance backstop and auto-deleveraging through a maintained ranking index, all bounded per block; the precompile precompiles/perps at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 that keeps the Hyperpax application's calls, reverts with typed custom errors and exports its ABI from the leaf package precompiles/perps/abi; and the eighteen markets seeded by SeedV6120 at 1000x. The version switch of 0x1015 is baseline task 1.2.1 exchangeVersionSwitch with the explicit live flag, the node wiring is baseline tasks 1.3.100 (module, SeedV6120, NewPrecompile at node/app.go:961-965), 1.3.101 (PerpsK), 1.3.102 (store key), 1.3.103 (EndBlocker) and 1.0.6 (synthetic receipts over RPC); the legacy precompile layout is owned by layerx-merge task 3.7.5."
requirements = ["3001", "3002", "3003", "3004", "3005", "3006", "3007", "3008", "3009", "3010", "3011", "3012", "3013", "3014", "3015", "3016", "3017", "3018", "3019", "3020", "3021", "3022", "3023"]
completion_task = "3.3.99"

[req.3001]
title = "The perpetuals interface at 0x1015 is frozen as Perps.sol and abi.json under a golden test"
ac_1 = "precompiles/perps/Perps.sol declares every function, event, structure and custom error of contracts/perps.md sections 2 to 19 (67 methods of 63 names, four views with an account overload, 30 events, the eleven structures OrderParams, AccountSummary, AccountState, PositionMargin, MarginTier, OrderDetails, PositionDetails, MarketConfig, MarketQuote, OpenPositionQuote and ClosePositionQuote, and 44 parameterless errors), and precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json is its compiled ABI, embedded by the leaf package precompiles/perps/abi (abi.go with //go:embed and no node imports) and loaded with MustGetABI (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:449) as the launchpad precompile loads its ABI (precompiles/launchpad/launchpad.go:180)."
ac_2 = "Every one of the 32 distinct 0x1015 methods the Hyperpax application calls keeps the selector the application encodes: the call sites at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:29-121, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:10-91, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:12-58, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:41-283, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:119-146 and Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePortfolioStats.ts:154-155; the four caller-resolved views getBalance, getLockedBalance, getAccountSummary and getMarginMode keep that selector and add the explicit account overload of contracts/perps.md section 1, which the application moves to (contracts/application.md)."
ac_3 = "The quote tuples keep the field order and types of Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:7-42 (OpenPositionQuote 10 fields, ClosePositionQuote 7 fields, MarketQuote 11 fields), and AccountSummary and PositionMargin keep the order of Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:121 and Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:241."
ac_4 = "A golden file precompiles/perps/testdata/abi_golden.txt lists each method signature with its selector, each event signature with its topic0 and each custom error with its 4-byte selector; any change to abi.json that alters a line fails the test, so the interface changes only together with contracts/perps.md."

[req.3002]
title = "Eighteen markets are seeded at activation with the Hyperpax ids at 1000x and governed only by upgrade handlers"
ac_1 = "SeedV6120(ctx sdk.Context, k Keeper) error writes the 18 markets of contracts/perps-markets.md with the ids and symbols of Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:168-185, max leverage 1000 on every market, tier class, tick, lot, impact notional, the fixed OI cap of classes A to D and F, the class E listing-age cap of contracts/perps-markets.md section 3.1 through Params.ClassEOiCaps, and listedAt set to the activation block time, after DefaultParams."
ac_2 = "SeedV6120 is idempotent: a second run leaves the store byte-identical and returns nil."
ac_3 = "Market.Validate in modules/perps/types/market.go refuses pxDecimals + szDecimals above 6, a zero OI cap, a max leverage above 1000 or a tier table whose deductions do not follow the recurrence of contracts/perps-markets.md section 1, with LXP_PERPS_INVALID_PARAMS."
ac_4 = "The tier tables follow the deduction recurrence: deduction(n) = deduction(n-1) + lowerBound(n) x (MMR(n) - MMR(n-1)), with tier 0 at 1000x, MMR 5 bps and IMR 10 bps on every market, giving BTC deductions 500, 8,000, 58,000, 433,000 and 2,308,000 USD, SOL 1,000, 16,000, 166,000 and 916,000 USD, NAS100 2,000, 39,500 and 339,500 USD, TSLA 1,125, 21,125 and 146,125 USD, PAX 45, 1,045, 7,295 and 57,295 USD and LINK 2,375, 17,375 and 142,375 USD."
ac_5 = "Keeper.SetMarket(ctx, authority, market) changes a market only for the governance authority, the pattern of UpdateParams (modules/launchpad/keeper/keeper.go:76-85); any other authority returns LXP_PERPS_UNAUTHORIZED."
ac_6 = "`function getMarket(uint256 marketId) external view returns (string memory name, string memory symbol, uint256 maxLeverage, uint256 maintenanceMarginBps, uint256 maxOpenInterest, bool enabled)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_7 = "`function getMarketConfig(uint256 marketId) external view returns (MarketConfig memory config)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_8 = "`function getActiveMarketIds() external view returns (uint256[] memory marketIds)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_9 = "`function totalMarkets() external view returns (uint256 count)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_10 = "`function isMarketActive(uint256 marketId) external view returns (bool active)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_11 = "LXP_PERPS_UNKNOWN_MARKET is registered with code 3 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsUnknownMarket() (selector 0x65644af8, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a market id is not stored."
ac_12 = "LXP_PERPS_MARKET_DISABLED is registered with code 4 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsMarketDisabled() (selector 0x386d4503, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the market is stored with enabled false."
ac_13 = "The OI cap of a class E market (PAX, SID, ASTER, TRUMP; contracts/perps-markets.md section 3, Class E, native and new listings) is the row of Params.ClassEOiCaps whose age range contains floor((blockTime - listedAt) / 86400): 2,000,000 USD per side for 0 to 29 days, 5,000,000 for 30 to 89, 10,000,000 for 90 to 179 and 25,000,000 from 180 days; getMarket.maxOpenInterest and getMarketConfig.oiCapUsd return the cap in force at the block of the call and Params.Validate refuses a table that is not strictly ascending in age and cap."

[req.3003]
title = "Each address holds one cross collateral account over the USDL ERC20 held by the perps module EVM address"
ac_1 = "Collateral is the USDL ERC20 0x85FcD13735F4309833A503EE804ea32395851479 (6 decimals, Params.CollateralToken; Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:75-79, Launch-x:contracts/deployments/paxeer-x-network-addresses.json:6) held as the ERC20 balance of the perps module EVM address (GetEVMAddressOrDefault, modules/evm/keeper/address.go:41, of authtypes.NewModuleAddress(\"perps\"); contracts/address-table.md, module accounts); it enters only by the deposit leg transferFrom(caller, perps module EVM address, amount), a nested evm.Call from the precompile address that needs the caller's allowance to 0x1015, and leaves only by the withdrawal leg transfer(caller, amount), a nested evm.Call with the perps module EVM address as caller (both the pattern of precompiles/xweb/xweb.go:482) capped at 100,000 gas; between them it moves only as store entries between accounts, perps_fees and perps_insurance. There is no bank denom for USDL, no pointer at the USDL address and no BankKeeper call on this venue."
ac_2 = "A token argument other than Params.CollateralToken, the zero address included, reverts with PerpsUnsupportedCollateral() before any token call; a token leg that reverts, returns false or data other than true or nothing, or moves the receiving balance by other than the amount reverts the whole call with PerpsTokenTransferFailed()."
ac_3 = "Withdrawable = equity - max(initial margin of positions and orders, 10 percent of position notional at mark), floored at 0 (contracts/perps-parameters.md section 2); withdraw, emergencyWithdraw, removeCollateral and transferCollateral are bounded by it, and every collateral change first settles each position of the account at mark (contracts/perps.md section 8)."
ac_4 = "An account is created by createVault, deposit or the first order method; other writes of an address without an account revert with PerpsNoAccount()."
ac_5 = "`function createVault() external returns (address vault)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 20,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:21."
ac_6 = "`function getVault(address user) external view returns (address vault)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:12."
ac_7 = "`function deposit(address token, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:48."
ac_8 = "`function withdraw(address token, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:58."
ac_9 = "`function emergencyWithdraw(address token) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:283."
ac_10 = "`function transferCollateral(address to, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 30,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_11 = "`function getBalance(address token) external view returns (uint256 balance)` and its account overload `function getBalance(address account, address token) external view returns (uint256 balance)` are declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json (gas table rows getBalance and getBalance0) and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as views, each charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); the caller form keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:30 and the account form serves Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePortfolioStats.ts:154 and every read without a from address."
ac_12 = "`function getLockedBalance(address token) external view returns (uint256 locked)` and its account overload `function getLockedBalance(address account, address token) external view returns (uint256 locked)` are declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json (rows getLockedBalance and getLockedBalance0) and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as views, each charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); the caller form keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useVault.ts:39 and the account form serves Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePortfolioStats.ts:155."
ac_13 = "`function getAccountSummary(address token) external view returns (AccountSummary memory summary)` and its account overload `function getAccountSummary(address account, address token) external view returns (AccountSummary memory summary)` are declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json (rows getAccountSummary and getAccountSummary0) and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as views, each charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); the caller form keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:239, which moves to the account form."
ac_14 = "`function getAccount(address account) external view returns (AccountState memory state)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_15 = "`event VaultCreated(address indexed user, address indexed vault)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on createVault on the first call of an account; vault is always 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_16 = "`event CollateralDeposited(address indexed account, uint256 amount, uint256 newBalance)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on deposit, topUpPosition, addCollateral and the deposit leg of the compatibility order methods, after the USDL contract's own Transfer(caller, perps module EVM address, amount) log of the deposit leg, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_17 = "`event CollateralWithdrawn(address indexed account, uint256 amount, uint256 newBalance)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on withdraw, emergencyWithdraw and removeCollateral, beside the USDL contract's own Transfer(perps module EVM address, caller, amount) log of the withdrawal leg, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_18 = "`event CollateralTransferred(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 amount)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on transferCollateral, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_19 = "LXP_PERPS_ZERO_AMOUNT is registered with code 6 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsZeroAmount() (selector 0x811bd7a1, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an amount or size argument is zero."
ac_20 = "LXP_PERPS_UNSUPPORTED_COLLATERAL is registered with code 7 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsUnsupportedCollateral() (selector 0x0a8b8f76, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a token argument is not the USDL ERC20 pointer."
ac_21 = "LXP_PERPS_INSUFFICIENT_COLLATERAL is registered with code 8 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsInsufficientCollateral() (selector 0x61997bc4, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the USDL balance of the caller or its allowance to 0x1015 is below a deposit, checked by StaticCall balanceOf and allowance before the token leg."
ac_22 = "LXP_PERPS_SELF_TRANSFER is registered with code 41 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsSelfTransfer() (selector 0x98bc8e6a, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when transferCollateral names the caller."
ac_23 = "LXP_PERPS_ZERO_ADDRESS is registered with code 42 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsZeroAddress() (selector 0xd6d30277, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an address argument is zero."
ac_24 = "LXP_PERPS_NO_ACCOUNT is registered with code 43 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsNoAccount() (selector 0xd7b16785, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a write other than createVault, deposit or a compatibility order names a caller without an account."
ac_25 = "LXP_PERPS_TOKEN_TRANSFER_FAILED is registered with code 44 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsTokenTransferFailed() (selector 0x6fdbf101, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a USDL token leg reverts, returns false or data other than true or nothing, or moves a balance by other than the amount."

[req.3004]
title = "Margin is cross only with tiered maintenance margin"
ac_1 = "Initial margin of a position is notional / leverage and of a resting order its notional at limit price / leverage; maintenance margin is notional at mark x MMR(tier) - deduction(tier) (contracts/perps-parameters.md section 2), replacing the single-rate check of lx_perps_maintenance_check (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_liquidate.c:23)."
ac_2 = "Leverage above the cap of the tier that contains the resulting notional reverts with PerpsLeverageTooHigh()."
ac_3 = "An order or position increase is accepted only if account equity minus the taker fee on the order notional at the account's taker rate (the fee reserve) is at least the initial margin of all positions and resting orders after the change (contracts/perps-parameters.md section 2); otherwise it reverts with PerpsInsufficientMargin()."
ac_4 = "The 1000x consequences of contracts/perps-parameters.md section 9 hold on every one of the 18 markets: tier 0 at 1000x with IMR 10 bps and MMR 5 bps, a 5 bps buffer, 14.5 bps minimum collateral for a taker open, a 9 bps taker round trip, maintenance reached at a 5 bps adverse move, and a position liquidatable from the block in which one capped funding index step exceeds its margin."
ac_5 = "Cross mode is the only mode: MarginMode Cross is 0 (Hyperpax:src/types/perps.ts:319-322) and every isolated-margin request reverts with PerpsCrossMarginOnly()."
ac_6 = "`function setMarginMode(uint8 mode) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 5,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:80."
ac_7 = "`function getMarginMode() external view returns (uint8 mode)` and its account overload `function getMarginMode(address account) external view returns (uint8 mode)` are declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json (rows getMarginMode and getMarginMode0) and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as views, each charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); the caller form keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:41, which moves to the account form."
ac_8 = "`function topUpPosition(uint256 positionId, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it deposits amount into the cross account by the transferFrom leg, the position id only proving that the caller holds the position, and keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:164."
ac_9 = "`function transferMargin(uint256 fromPositionId, uint256 toPositionId, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/account.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 5,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it always reverts with PerpsCrossMarginOnly(), so the selector the application ABI carries (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:197) reverts with a typed error while the application removes its caller (contracts/application.md)."
ac_10 = "`function getPositionMargin(uint256 positionId) external view returns (PositionMargin memory margin)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarginMode.ts:119."
ac_11 = "`function getMarginTiers(uint256 marketId) external view returns (MarginTier[] memory tiers)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_12 = "`function checkLiquidatable(uint256 positionId) external view returns (bool liquidatable, uint256 marginBps)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_13 = "LXP_PERPS_INSUFFICIENT_MARGIN is registered with code 9 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsInsufficientMargin() (selector 0x12b52d40, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an order, withdrawal or transfer would leave equity below the initial margin or the transfer requirement."
ac_14 = "LXP_PERPS_LEVERAGE_TOO_HIGH is registered with code 10 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsLeverageTooHigh() (selector 0x794b54cf, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when requested leverage exceeds the tier maximum for the resulting notional."
ac_15 = "LXP_PERPS_CROSS_MARGIN_ONLY is registered with code 32 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsCrossMarginOnly() (selector 0x6ff920cc, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when setMarginMode names isolated or transferMargin is called."

[req.3005]
title = "Orders are validated against tick, lot, value, leverage, reduce-only and cloid rules"
ac_1 = "Order validation runs in the order of contracts/perps.md section 5 (pause, account, market, fresh price, order type and time in force, tick, lot, value, leverage, open-order limit, cloid, reduce-only, margin) and reproduces the checks of order_validate (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:183) including the time-in-force bound at src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:199."
ac_2 = "A limit price that is not a multiple of the tick reverts with PerpsTickSize(), and a size that rounds to zero lots reverts with PerpsLotSize()."
ac_3 = "Order value is bounded: below 10 USD reverts with PerpsMinOrderValue(); above the market-order maximum for the market's leverage band, or 10 times it for limit orders, reverts with PerpsMaxOrderValue()."
ac_4 = "A cloid is unique per account and market among open orders: a second open order with the same cloid reverts with PerpsDuplicateCloid(); the cloid index frees on cancel, fill and expiry."
ac_5 = "An account holds at most 1,000 open orders; the next placement reverts with PerpsTooManyOpenOrders()."
ac_6 = "A resting order with a deadline below block time is expired in EndBlock and frees its margin; a placement with a deadline already below block time reverts with PerpsDeadlineExpired()."
ac_7 = "`function placeOrder(OrderParams calldata p) external returns (uint256 orderId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 250,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_8 = "`function placeLimitOrder(uint256 marketId, bool isLong, uint256 triggerPrice, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 leverage, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount) external returns (uint256 orderId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 350,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it runs the transferFrom deposit leg for collateralAmount, then places a GTC limit order of notional min(sizeUsd, collateralAmount x leverage / (1 + leverage x taker rate)) at triggerPrice, and keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:36."
ac_9 = "`function placeStopLimitOrder(uint256 marketId, bool isLong, uint256 triggerPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 leverage, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount) external returns (uint256 orderId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 350,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it runs the transferFrom deposit leg, sizes as placeLimitOrder at limitPrice and keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:58."
ac_10 = "`function cancelOrder(uint256 orderId) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 20,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:71."
ac_11 = "`function cancelByCloid(uint256 marketId, bytes16 cloid) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 20,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_12 = "`function getOrder(uint256 orderId) external view returns (address user, uint256 marketId, bool isLong, uint8 orderType, uint256 triggerPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 leverage, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount, bool active)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:10."
ac_13 = "`function getOrderDetails(uint256 orderId) external view returns (OrderDetails memory details)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_14 = "`function getUserOrderIds(address user) external view returns (uint256[] memory orderIds)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:19."
ac_15 = "`event OrderPlaced(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, uint8 orderType, bool isLong, uint256 triggerPrice, uint256 sizeUsd)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every order placement, including the implicit market order of openPosition, addSize, closePosition and partialClose, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_16 = "`event OrderOptions(uint256 indexed orderId, uint8 timeInForce, bool reduceOnly, uint256 limitPrice, uint256 acceptablePrice, uint64 deadline, bytes16 cloid)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on directly after OrderPlaced for every order, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_17 = "`event OrderCancelled(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed user)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on cancelOrder, cancelByCloid, emergencyWithdraw, self-trade prevention, IOC and FOK remainders, reduce-only shrink and liquidation order sweeps, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_18 = "`event OrderExpired(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on EndBlock when a resting order passes its deadline, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_19 = "LXP_PERPS_TICK_SIZE is registered with code 11 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsTickSize() (selector 0x73f775c1, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a limit or trigger price is not a multiple of the market tick."
ac_20 = "LXP_PERPS_LOT_SIZE is registered with code 12 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsLotSize() (selector 0x8e28a39a, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the size rounds down to zero lots."
ac_21 = "LXP_PERPS_MIN_ORDER_VALUE is registered with code 13 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsMinOrderValue() (selector 0xd1d78b4f, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when order notional below the minimum order value."
ac_22 = "LXP_PERPS_MAX_ORDER_VALUE is registered with code 14 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsMaxOrderValue() (selector 0xe9933ae1, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when order notional above the maximum for its kind."
ac_23 = "LXP_PERPS_INVALID_TIME_IN_FORCE is registered with code 16 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsInvalidTimeInForce() (selector 0x47306489, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when timeInForce is not 0 to 3 or not allowed for the order type."
ac_24 = "LXP_PERPS_INVALID_ORDER_TYPE is registered with code 17 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsInvalidOrderType() (selector 0x7be0d47b, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when orderType is not 0 to 5."
ac_25 = "LXP_PERPS_SLIPPAGE_EXCEEDED is registered with code 21 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsSlippageExceeded() (selector 0xb6c82773, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a taker order whose opposite side is not empty fills nothing inside its bound (the one slippage rule of contracts/perps.md section 6); a partial fill inside the bound stands and no volume-weighted price check is made after matching."
ac_26 = "LXP_PERPS_DEADLINE_EXPIRED is registered with code 22 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsDeadlineExpired() (selector 0xd28988d8, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when deadline is non-zero and below the block time."
ac_27 = "LXP_PERPS_REDUCE_ONLY_VIOLATION is registered with code 23 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsReduceOnlyViolation() (selector 0x8adbf151, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a reduce-only order would increase or flip a position."
ac_28 = "LXP_PERPS_DUPLICATE_CLOID is registered with code 24 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsDuplicateCloid() (selector 0x6298d438, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a non-zero cloid is already used by an open order of the account in the market."
ac_29 = "LXP_PERPS_UNKNOWN_ORDER is registered with code 25 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsUnknownOrder() (selector 0x1930eff6, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an order id or cloid names no open order."
ac_30 = "LXP_PERPS_NOT_ORDER_HOLDER is registered with code 26 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsNotOrderHolder() (selector 0xedef32ca, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the caller is not the account that placed the order."
ac_31 = "LXP_PERPS_TOO_MANY_OPEN_ORDERS is registered with code 31 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsTooManyOpenOrders() (selector 0xfc1f0263, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the account holds the maximum number of open orders."

[req.3006]
title = "One price-time priority book per market matches orders deterministically"
ac_1 = "Matching crosses on price (crosses, src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:63), picks the best maker by price then placement sequence (better_match and best_match, src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:71-81 and :84, whose equal-price order by global sequence and then order id agrees with this rule) and fills at the maker price, as lx_perps_book_match (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:121) does; each fill books one fillUsd = base x price / 1e18, rounded down, to both parties and settles both positions at the fill price."
ac_2 = "POST_ONLY orders that would cross revert with PerpsPostOnlyWouldCross() and FOK orders that cannot fill completely revert with PerpsFokNotFilled() with no state change, the rules at src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:253 and :262."
ac_3 = "Self-trade prevention cancels the resting order of the same account and continues; at most 32 fills per taker order and the IOC remainder is cancelled."
ac_4 = "Book keys order bids by 2^256-1 minus price and asks by price, each followed by the 8-byte placement sequence, so ascending iteration of prefix 0x06 yields best price then earliest order (contracts/perps.md section 20), the order better_match applies (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:71)."
ac_5 = "One slippage rule for every taker order: the bound is the limit price of a LIMIT order and, for a MARKET order, a triggered market order and every compatibility method, acceptablePrice when non-zero, otherwise mark x (1 +- 5,000 ppm) rounded to the tick toward mark (Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:354); matching stops at the first resting price beyond the bound and the IOC remainder is cancelled; an empty opposite side reverts with PerpsNoLiquidity() and a non-empty side with no fill inside the bound reverts with PerpsSlippageExceeded()."
ac_6 = "The Go engine reproduces the golden vectors in modules/perps/keeper/testdata/matching_golden.json, recorded from the Go engine, each case carrying an expectation computed by hand from contracts/perps.md section 6 (price then sequence, self-trade prevention, the 32-fill cap, the bound rule): for each sequence of placements and cancels the fills, remaining book and events equal the expectation. The C book is not the reference, since it has no self-trade prevention and no fill cap; the book compaction of compact_book (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_book.c:102) has no observable effect."
ac_7 = "`event OrderExecuted(uint256 indexed orderId, uint256 indexed positionId, uint256 executionPrice)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on whenever an order's fills change a position, once per order per transaction or EndBlock pass, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_8 = "`event Fill(uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 indexed makerOrderId, uint256 indexed takerOrderId, address maker, address taker, bool takerIsLong, uint256 price, uint256 sizeUsd, int256 makerFeeUsd, uint256 takerFeeUsd)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every maker-taker match, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_9 = "LXP_PERPS_POST_ONLY_WOULD_CROSS is registered with code 18 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsPostOnlyWouldCross() (selector 0x096e07cd, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a post-only order would take liquidity."
ac_10 = "LXP_PERPS_FOK_NOT_FILLED is registered with code 19 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsFokNotFilled() (selector 0xc3dbe522, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a fill-or-kill order cannot fill completely."
ac_11 = "LXP_PERPS_NO_LIQUIDITY is registered with code 20 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsNoLiquidity() (selector 0xef4eb50b, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the opposite side of a taker order holds no resting order."

[req.3007]
title = "Trigger orders and attached TP/SL execute at mark in EndBlock or by executeOrder"
ac_1 = "Trigger conditions follow contracts/perps.md section 7 and are evaluated against the mark of the current block after the mark update."
ac_2 = "At most 256 triggered orders per block, in the key order of the trigger index (contracts/perps.md section 20): market id ascending, per direction the trigger prices the mark crossed in crossing order (buy-side from the lowest trigger price up, sell-side from the highest down), then ascending placement sequence; the rest stay in the index and are evaluated first in the next block."
ac_3 = "An attached TP/SL pair is one-cancels-other and is removed when the position closes."
ac_4 = "STOP_LIMIT orders become resting limit orders when triggered and take a new placement sequence at trigger for book priority."
ac_5 = "`function placeTakeProfitOrder(uint256 positionId, uint256 triggerPrice) external returns (uint256 orderId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 60,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:81."
ac_6 = "`function placeStopLossOrder(uint256 positionId, uint256 triggerPrice) external returns (uint256 orderId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 60,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:91."
ac_7 = "`function setPositionTpSl(uint256 positionId, uint256 takeProfitPrice, uint256 stopLossPrice) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 60,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_8 = "`function executeOrder(uint256 orderId) external returns (uint256 positionId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/orders.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 250,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_9 = "`event OrderTriggered(uint256 indexed orderId, uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 markPrice)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on EndBlock trigger evaluation and executeOrder, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_10 = "`event PositionTpSlSet(uint256 indexed positionId, uint256 takeProfitPrice, uint256 stopLossPrice)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on setPositionTpSl and placeOrder with takeProfitPrice or stopLossPrice, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_11 = "LXP_PERPS_INVALID_TRIGGER_PRICE is registered with code 29 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsInvalidTriggerPrice() (selector 0xd7580015, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a trigger price is zero, off tick or on the wrong side of mark for its kind."
ac_12 = "LXP_PERPS_TRIGGER_NOT_REACHED is registered with code 30 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsTriggerNotReached() (selector 0xc6298dab, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when executeOrder names an order whose trigger mark has not reached."

[req.3008]
title = "Positions net per account and market with weighted entry and realised PnL"
ac_1 = "One position per account and market; an opposite fill reduces, closes or flips it, the netting of execute_position_open and execute_position_close (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1252 and :1405)."
ac_2 = "Each position carries a reference price, a cost basis (size x reference price / 1e18) and a funding basis; a settlement realises side x (size x price / 1e18 - cost basis) and the funding since the last settlement into collateral and resets the reference price. Settlements run at every fill for both parties at the fill price, at every collateral change for each position of the account at mark, at every liquidation, backstop and ADL step, and in the bounded EndBlock cursor sweep (contracts/perps.md section 8), so profit one side realises is carried as the equal unrealised loss of the other side and the solvency identity of contracts/perps.md section 24 holds after every step. Credits round down and debits round up to the USDL unit, the remainder to residueUsd; a loss beyond collateral floors it at 0 and records the deficit, drawn by InsuranceDraw, then VaultDeficit and ADL. PositionClosed.realizedPnl is closed size x (exit - entry) x side against the displayed entry, the lx_perps_pnl_compute rule (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_funding.c:20)."
ac_3 = "Entry price on increase is the size-weighted average rounded half up at 1e-18 USD."
ac_4 = "Reduce-only orders never increase or flip a position; a resting reduce-only order larger than the position is shrunk or cancelled after each fill."
ac_5 = "`function openPosition(uint256 marketId, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount, uint256 leverage, bool isLong) external returns (uint256 positionId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 350,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it runs the transferFrom deposit leg for collateral c, then a MARKET IOC order of notional N = c x L / (1 + L x f) rounded down, sized in base at the highest fillable price (the default bound for a buy, the best bid for a sell) and rounded down to the lot, so N / L + taker fee <= c and the margin rule passes for an account that holds nothing else; it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:63."
ac_6 = "`function addSize(uint256 positionId, uint256 additionalCollateral, uint256 leverage) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 350,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it applies the openPosition sizing to additionalCollateral in the position's direction and keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:121."
ac_7 = "`function addCollateral(uint256 positionId, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method that deposits amount into the cross account by the transferFrom leg, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:100."
ac_8 = "`function removeCollateral(uint256 positionId, uint256 amount) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method that pays amount to the caller by the transfer leg within withdrawable, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 130,000 (100,000 of it the token leg) through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:110."
ac_9 = "`function closePosition(uint256 positionId) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 250,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:79."
ac_10 = "`function partialClose(uint256 positionId, uint256 closeSizeUsd) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 250,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:89."
ac_11 = "`function closePositionWithParams(uint256 positionId, uint256 closeSizeUsd, uint256 acceptablePrice, uint64 deadline) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 250,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_12 = "`function getPosition(uint256 positionId) external view returns (address user, uint256 marketId, bool isLong, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 collateralUsd, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount, uint256 entryPrice, uint256 timestamp, bool active)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:29."
ac_13 = "`function getPositionDetails(uint256 positionId) external view returns (PositionDetails memory details)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_14 = "`function getUserPositionIds(address user) external view returns (uint256[] memory positionIds)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:38."
ac_15 = "`function getUserMarketPosition(address user, uint256 marketId) external view returns (uint256 positionId)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_16 = "`event PositionOpened(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, bool isLong, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 leverage, uint256 entryPrice, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on the first fill that gives an account a position in a market, and a fill that flips a position's side, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_17 = "`event PositionModified(uint256 indexed positionId, uint256 newSizeUsd, uint256 newCollateralUsd, uint256 newCollateralAmount)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every fill that increases or reduces a position without closing it, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_18 = "`event PositionEntryPriceChanged(uint256 indexed positionId, uint256 oldEntryPrice, uint256 newEntryPrice)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every fill that increases a position, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_19 = "`event PositionClosed(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 closedSizeUsd, uint256 exitPrice, int256 realizedPnl, bool isFullClose)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every fill that reduces or closes a position, including liquidation and ADL fills, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_20 = "`event TradeSettled(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, uint8 tradeType, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 executionPrice, int256 grossPnl, uint256 totalFeesUsd, int256 fundingPaidUsd, uint256 netPayoutTokens)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every fill applied to a position; tradeType OPEN 0, CLOSE 1, LIQUIDATION 2, REDUCE 3, INCREASE 4, ADL 5, BACKSTOP 6 (0 to 3 the values of Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:270-275) and fundingPaidUsd negative when the position pays, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_21 = "LXP_PERPS_UNKNOWN_POSITION is registered with code 27 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsUnknownPosition() (selector 0x6dcd3d95, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a position id names no open position."
ac_22 = "LXP_PERPS_NOT_POSITION_HOLDER is registered with code 28 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsNotPositionHolder() (selector 0xe59be79c, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when the caller is not the account that holds the position."
ac_23 = "LXP_PERPS_CLOSE_SIZE_EXCEEDS_POSITION is registered with code 40 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsCloseSizeExceedsPosition() (selector 0x1be787db, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a partial close asks more than the position notional."

[req.3009]
title = "Trading fees follow the 14 UTC day volume tiers [d-13, d] with maker rebates"
ac_1 = "Fee tier is the highest tier whose threshold the account's 14-day volume exceeds, the sum of the daily buckets keyed by d = floor(blockTime / 86400) for days d-13 to d inclusive, so a fill counts toward the tier of the account's next order on the same day (contracts/perps-parameters.md section 1)."
ac_2 = "Fees round up to the USDL unit (1e-6 USD) and rebates round down, the remainder to residueUsd; fees credit the store account perps_fees and a rebate is paid from it."
ac_3 = "Buckets of days before d-13 drop out of the volume and are deleted when day d first writes; venue volume buckets over the same window give the maker share for rebate tiers."
ac_4 = "Liquidation fee is 0 and the insurance share of trading fees is Params.InsuranceSharePpm, 0 ppm at activation; the split helper of lx_perps_liquidation_fee_split (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_liquidate.c:46) is not reproduced."
ac_5 = "`function getFees() external view returns (uint256 takerFeePpm, uint256 makerFeePpm, uint256 liquidationFeePpm, uint256 insuranceSharePpm)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it returns the tier 0 taker and maker rates, 0 and Params.InsuranceSharePpm in ppm, the unit its output names state, and is listed in contracts/perps.md section 25 against the bps outputs of Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/MarketRegistryFacet.json:214, which no application hook calls."
ac_6 = "`function getFeeTier(address account) external view returns (uint8 tier, uint256 takerFeePpm, int256 makerFeePpm, uint256 volume14dUsd)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_7 = "`function getProtocolAccounts() external view returns (address feeRecipient, address insuranceFund)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_8 = "`event FeeCollected(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, uint8 feeType, uint256 feeUsd, uint256 feeTokens, address token)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every taker fee, maker fee and maker rebate booking; feeType TRADING 0 for a fee charged and MAKER_REBATE 4 for a rebate paid (0 the Trading value of Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:262-267, values 1 to 3 never emitted), through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."

[req.3010]
title = "The mark price combines the order book with the pricefeed module"
ac_1 = "The keeper reads GetPrice(ctx, marketId) of modules/pricefeed/keeper through PricefeedKeeper in modules/perps/types/expected_keepers.go, replacing the kernel price read oracle_price_current (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:294)."
ac_2 = "Mark = median(Index + EMA150s(mid - Index), median(best bid, best ask, last trade), pricefeed Mark as contracts/pricefeed.md#mark-price defines it), where a component that is undefined (an order side with no resting order, or no trade yet in the market) is set to Index; the mid uses the book as book_mid_price does (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1511)."
ac_3 = "A stale price refuses opening orders, market closes and liquidations of that market with PerpsPriceStale() and EndBlock skips its triggers and liquidations; cancels and deposits stay open and isMarketActive returns false."
ac_4 = "MarkPriceUpdated is emitted once per market per block in which the mark changes."
ac_5 = "`function getMarkPrice(uint256 marketId) external view returns (uint256 markPrice)` keeps the one-output shape of the Diamond facets (Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/PriceFeedFacet.json:77, Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/VirtualAMMFacet.json:91) and is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_6 = "`function quoteMarket(uint256 marketId) external view returns (MarketQuote memory quote)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:119."
ac_7 = "`event MarkPriceUpdated(uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 markPrice, uint256 indexPrice, uint256 midPrice)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on EndBlock once per market per block in which the mark changes, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_8 = "LXP_PERPS_PRICE_STALE is registered with code 5 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsPriceStale() (selector 0x737dedba, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when GetPrice reports fresh false for an order, open, close-at-market or liquidation."
ac_9 = "`function getMarkPriceDetails(uint256 marketId) external view returns (uint256 markPrice, uint256 indexPrice, uint256 midPrice, bool fresh)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it returns the mark components and the pricefeed freshness flag."

[req.3011]
title = "Funding samples the premium every 5 seconds and advances a lazy hourly index with a 4 percent cap"
ac_1 = "Premium samples follow contracts/perps-parameters.md section 3 using the impact bid and ask of the market's impact notional."
ac_2 = "The 8-hour rate F = P + clamp(I - P, -0.0005, 0.0005) and the hourly rate F / 8 capped at 4 percent, replacing the bps clamp of lx_perps_funding_rate (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_funding.c:54, clamp at :83-84)."
ac_3 = "At each whole hour of block time the market's cumulative funding index per unit of base advances by oracle x hourly rate (lx_perps_funding_index_update, src/modules/perps/lx_perps_funding.c:90) and no position is visited; a position's funding is side x size x (index now - index at its last settlement), the lx_perps_funding_owed rule (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_funding.c:200), counted in equity at every read and settled into collateral at each settlement of the position, at the latest by the EndBlock cursor sweep, replacing the tick command execute_funding_tick (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1468)."
ac_4 = "Funding a position pays rounds up and funding it receives rounds down, to 1e-18 USD and to the USDL unit; the residue stays in the USDL balance of the perps module EVM address, booked in residueUsd (prefix 0x15), and is never credited to an account or to perps_insurance."
ac_5 = "The hourly index advance runs in EndBlock step 3, before the cursor sweep (step 6) and the liquidation pass (step 7) of the same EndBlock, and equity includes funding owed by the index at every read, so a position that one index step makes liquidatable is liquidatable in that block."
ac_6 = "`function getCurrentFundingRate(uint256 marketId) external view returns (int256 ratePerSecond)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_7 = "`function getFundingState(uint256 marketId) external view returns (int256 cumulativeLong, int256 cumulativeShort, uint256 lastUpdate, int256 ratePerSecond)` keeps the tuple of the Diamond facet (Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/FundingRateFacet.json:73) and is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); cumulativeLong is the index a long pays per unit of base, cumulativeShort its negation."
ac_8 = "`function getPositionFunding(uint256 positionId) external view returns (int256 fundingOwedUsd)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it returns the funding since the position's last settlement with the interface sign of contracts/perps.md section 2, negative when the position pays and positive when it receives, the same sign as PositionFundingApplied.fundingPaymentUsd, TradeSettled.fundingPaidUsd and ClosePositionQuote.fundingOwed."
ac_9 = "`event FundingRateUpdated(uint256 indexed marketId, int256 newRatePerSecond, int256 fundingRate24h)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on EndBlock at each whole hour when the hourly rate is fixed, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_10 = "`event FundingSettled(uint256 indexed marketId, int256 fundingRate, int256 longPayment, int256 shortPayment)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on EndBlock at each whole hour when the cumulative index advances; longPayment and shortPayment are the side totals implied by open interest x index step with the interface sign (longPayment negative when longs pay), informational because positions settle lazily, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_11 = "`event PositionFundingApplied(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, int256 fundingPaymentUsd, uint256 newCollateralUsd, uint256 newCollateralAmount)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every settlement of a position whose funding since its last settlement is non-zero (fills, collateral changes, liquidation, backstop and ADL steps and the EndBlock cursor sweep), fundingPaymentUsd negative when the position pays, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_12 = "`function getFundingDetails(uint256 marketId) external view returns (int256 cumulativeFundingPerUnit, uint256 lastSettleTime, int256 lastHourlyRate, int256 premiumSampleSum, uint256 premiumSampleCount)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it returns the sampling state of the market."

[req.3012]
title = "Open interest is equal on both sides and capped per side, with no borrowing fee"
ac_1 = "Open interest is kept per market and side in base units and reported in USD at mark; every fill creates or removes equal long and short size, so long OI equals short OI in every market (contracts/perps.md section 24 item 2)."
ac_2 = "The cap in force is the fixed market cap of classes A to D and F and, for class E (native and new listings), the listing-age row of Params.ClassEOiCaps (contracts/perps-markets.md section 3.1); the venue charges no borrowing fee on open interest and keeps no borrowing index anywhere, funding being the only carry (the Hyperliquid model, contracts/perps-parameters.md sections 3 and 4)."
ac_3 = "A fill that would take one side's OI above the cap reverts with PerpsOpenInterestCap(); reducing fills are always allowed."
ac_4 = "OpenInterestChanged is emitted on every fill that changes OI, with both sides after the fill."
ac_5 = "No borrowing method is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json: getBorrowingFeeRate and getPendingBorrowingFee of the Diamond (Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/PositionFacet.ts:576, :619), which no application hook calls, revert with empty data in Prepare (contracts/perps.md sections 1 and 25), and TestABIGoldenFile fails if any method or event name containing Borrowing appears."
ac_6 = "quoteMarket(marketId).longOI and .shortOI equal getOpenInterest(marketId) in the same state, and getMarket(marketId).maxOpenInterest and getMarketConfig(marketId).oiCapUsd return the cap in force at the block of the call."
ac_7 = "Settlement books trading fees and funding only: PositionDetails, TradeSettled, OpenPositionQuote and ClosePositionQuote carry no borrowing field, MarketState and Position (contracts/perps.md section 20) hold no borrowing index, and EndBlock has no borrowing step (contracts/perps.md section 23)."
ac_8 = "`function getOpenInterest(uint256 marketId) external view returns (uint256 longOI, uint256 shortOI)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:47."
ac_9 = "No BorrowingFeeAccrued event is declared or emitted; FeeCollected carries feeType TRADING 0 and MAKER_REBATE 4 only, and InsuranceContribution sources are TRADING_FEE 0, BACKSTOP_MARGIN 1 and BACKSTOP_PROFIT 2."
ac_10 = "`event OpenInterestChanged(uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 longOI, uint256 shortOI, uint256 deltaUsd, bool isIncrease)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every fill that changes a market's open interest, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_11 = "LXP_PERPS_OPEN_INTEREST_CAP is registered with code 15 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsOpenInterestCap() (selector 0x021901d6, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an opening fill would lift a side above the market cap."

[req.3013]
title = "Accounts below maintenance are liquidated against the book in slices"
ac_1 = "Liquidation is account level and triggered by equity < maintenance margin; the order sweep and closing orders replace the leg builder of lx_perps_liquidation_legs_build and lx_perps_liquidate_execute (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_liquidate.c:82 and :177)."
ac_2 = "Positions above 100,000 USD close in 20 percent slices, one per 30 seconds of block time; a second slice inside the window reverts with PerpsLiquidationCooldown()."
ac_3 = "EndBlock finds candidates through the MarginRatioIndex (prefix 0x12, bucket = min(65535, floor(100 x equity / maintenance margin)) at the account's last settlement), walking from bucket 0 upward, visiting at most Params.LiquidationScanPerBlock accounts (1,024 at activation), recomputing each visited account at mark and re-bucketing it, and liquidating at most 64 accounts and 256 slices per block; the rest carry to the next block and no step scans every account, a stale bucket being refreshed at the latest once per sweep cycle of Params.SweepPositionsPerBlock positions (512 at activation)."
ac_4 = "Liquidation price follows contracts/perps-parameters.md section 6 with the other positions held constant."
ac_5 = "A healthy account reverts with PerpsNotLiquidatable() and the caller is never paid."
ac_6 = "`function liquidate(uint256 positionId) external` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/positions.go as a state-changing method, charged DefaultGasCost(input, true) plus 300,000 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_7 = "`function getLiquidationPrice(uint256 positionId) external view returns (uint256 liquidationPrice)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_8 = "`event Liquidation(uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed user, uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 liquidationPrice, uint256 penalty, address keeper)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on each market liquidation slice, from liquidate or EndBlock (keeper is the zero address in EndBlock), through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_9 = "LXP_PERPS_NOT_LIQUIDATABLE is registered with code 33 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsNotLiquidatable() (selector 0xce578943, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when liquidate names a position of an account at or above maintenance."
ac_10 = "LXP_PERPS_LIQUIDATION_COOLDOWN is registered with code 34 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsLiquidationCooldown() (selector 0x6098ef55, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when liquidate names a large position inside its partial-liquidation cooldown."

[req.3014]
title = "The insurance fund backstops accounts below two thirds of maintenance"
ac_1 = "When equity < 2/3 x maintenance margin, perps_insurance takes over every position at mark and the remaining collateral, emitting BackstopLiquidation and InsuranceContribution source BACKSTOP_MARGIN 1."
ac_2 = "The insurance fund closes its backstop positions in EndBlock step 9 under the slice rule, crediting profit as InsuranceContribution source BACKSTOP_PROFIT 2."
ac_3 = "An account deficit, the part of a realised loss beyond collateral that settlement records with collateral floored at 0 (contracts/perps.md section 8), is drawn from perps_insurance with InsuranceDraw, the role of lx_perps_insurance_cover (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_insurance.c:42)."
ac_4 = "When the fund cannot cover a deficit, VaultDeficit is emitted and ADL starts, the role of lx_perps_deficit_record (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_insurance.c:58)."
ac_5 = "`function getInsuranceBalance(address token) external view returns (uint256 balance)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it returns the store balance of perps_insurance in USDL units, a store entry over the one USDL ERC20 balance of the perps module EVM address, and reverts with PerpsUnsupportedCollateral() for any other token."
ac_6 = "`event BackstopLiquidation(address indexed account, uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 markPrice, uint256 marginTakenUsd)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on each position the insurance fund takes over, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_7 = "`event InsuranceContribution(address indexed token, uint256 amount, uint8 source)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every credit to the insurance fund; source TRADING_FEE 0 (the Params.InsuranceSharePpm share of trading fees, 0 at activation), BACKSTOP_MARGIN 1, BACKSTOP_PROFIT 2, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_8 = "`event InsuranceDraw(uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 amount, uint256 newBalance)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on every debit of the insurance fund to cover a negative account, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_9 = "`event VaultDeficit(address indexed token, uint256 deficit)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on when the insurance fund cannot cover a negative account and ADL starts, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."

[req.3015]
title = "Auto-deleveraging ranks opposite profitable positions and executes at the previous mark"
ac_1 = "Rank = (mark / entry for a long, entry / mark for a short) x (position notional / account value), descending, ties by ascending position id, read from the per-market AdlRankIndex (prefix 0x13) that every position write rewrites, never by sorting every position, replacing candidate_compare and candidate_sort (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_insurance.c:95 and :102)."
ac_2 = "ADL reduces the deficit position and ranked counterparties by the same size at the previous block's mark until the deficit is closed, at most 64 counterparty positions per block with the remainder carried, as lx_perps_adl_execute (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_insurance.c:117) and execute_adl (src/modules/perps/lx_perps_dispatch.c:1676) apply it."
ac_3 = "ADL never reduces a losing position and runs only after the insurance fund is exhausted."
ac_4 = "ADL scenarios replay the vectors in modules/perps/keeper/testdata/adl_golden.json."
ac_5 = "`function getADLRank(uint256 positionId) external view returns (uint256 rankScore, bool profitable)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/views.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."
ac_6 = "`event ADLExecuted(uint256 indexed positionId, uint256 deleveragedSizeUsd)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on each deficit position reduced by ADL, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."
ac_7 = "`event ADLMatched(uint256 indexed marketId, uint256 indexed positionId, address indexed account, uint256 sizeUsd, uint256 price, uint256 rankScore)` is logged from 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001015 on each counterparty position reduced by ADL, through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) inside a transaction or in the EndBlock synthetic receipt written with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36)."

[req.3016]
title = "Quotes predict execution exactly without changing state"
ac_1 = "quoteOpenPosition applies the openPosition sizing rule N = c x L / (1 + L x f) at the highest fillable price and walks the book with the same matching code, bound and fee tier as execution on a cached context that is discarded, so it returns what openPosition fills in the same block state."
ac_2 = "quoteClosePosition and quotePartialClose return exit price, PnL, fees, funding and payout equal to the close executed in the same state."
ac_3 = "Quotes never write state: the store hash before and after any quote is identical."
ac_4 = "quoteMarket returns priceStale true when the pricefeed price is not fresh."
ac_5 = "`function quoteOpenPosition(uint256 marketId, address collateralToken, uint256 collateralAmount, uint256 leverage, bool isLong) external view returns (OpenPositionQuote memory quote)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/quotes.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:136 and its fee and liquidation price are the confirmation source of the application's order dialog (contracts/application.md)."
ac_6 = "`function quoteClosePosition(uint256 positionId) external view returns (ClosePositionQuote memory quote)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/quotes.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); it keeps the application call at Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:146."
ac_7 = "`function quotePartialClose(uint256 positionId, uint256 closeSizeUsd) external view returns (uint256 exitPrice, int256 closedPnl, uint256 fee, uint256 estimatedPayout)` is declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json and served by precompiles/perps/quotes.go as a view, charged DefaultGasCost(input, false) plus 0 through WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118)."

[req.3017]
title = "The precompile enforces gas, call kind, value, pause and custom-error rules uniformly"
ac_1 = "NewPrecompile builds the precompile without WithLXPReasons and with WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115-118); RequiredGas (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:165) charges DefaultGasCost (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:441-447) plus the surcharge of contracts/perps.md section 21, where every method with a USDL token leg carries 100,000 of its surcharge for the nested call capped at 100,000 gas and the four account overloads are keyed getBalance0, getLockedBalance0, getAccountSummary0 and getMarginMode0; the charge does not depend on state, so eth_estimateGas returns the exact charge apart from the gas of the logs."
ac_2 = "Writes under STATICCALL revert with PerpsStaticCall() and any DELEGATECALL reverts with PerpsDelegatecall(), the checks of the exchange Execute (precompiles/layerxexchange/layerxexchange.go:205-206 and :213-214); Run reuses Prepare (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:227) and keeps the custom error data beside the error before it becomes vm.ErrExecutionReverted (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:187-216), and a selector absent from the perps ABI reverts with empty data."
ac_3 = "Value sent to any method fails ValidateNonPayable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:374)."
ac_4 = "With Params.Paused true every state-changing method outside the exit set closePosition, partialClose, closePositionWithParams, cancelOrder, cancelByCloid, deposit, addCollateral and topUpPosition reverts with PerpsPaused(): every opening or increasing order (placeOrder with reduceOnly false, placeLimitOrder, placeStopLimitOrder, placeTakeProfitOrder, placeStopLossOrder, setPositionTpSl, executeOrder, openPosition, addSize), withdraw, emergencyWithdraw, removeCollateral, transferCollateral, createVault, setMarginMode, transferMargin and liquidate as a transaction; views, EndBlock liquidation, backstop, ADL, funding, reduce-only trigger evaluation and expiry keep running. The exit set is kept in modules/perps/keeper/pause.go, because pauseExitPaths (modules/layerxgov/types/proposal.go:28) has no perps entry, and LXP_PAUSED_SCOPE (modules/layerxgov/types/proposal.go:26) is not used by this venue."
ac_5 = "The precompile reaches the keeper only through PerpsKeepers { PerpsK() } on the application keepers, which baseline task 1.3.101 adds in node/precompiles.go and precompiles/utils/expected_keepers.go, the type-assertion pattern of XWebKeepers (precompiles/utils/expected_keepers.go:57-61, precompiles/xweb/xweb.go:153); keepers without it make every call revert."
ac_6 = "LXP_PERPS_STATIC_CALL is registered with code 36 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsStaticCall() (selector 0x32a35088, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when a write method is reached through STATICCALL."
ac_7 = "LXP_PERPS_DELEGATECALL is registered with code 37 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsDelegatecall() (selector 0x856fe7e1, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when any method is reached through DELEGATECALL."
ac_8 = "LXP_PERPS_PAUSED is registered with code 45 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsPaused() (selector 0xe0753633, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when Params.Paused is true and a state-changing method outside the pause exit set is called."

[req.3018]
title = "EndBlock runs the venue's periodic work and publishes its logs as a synthetic receipt"
ac_1 = "modules/perps/abci.go EndBlocker(ctx, k) runs the nine bounded steps of contracts/perps.md section 23 in order (prices, premium samples, hourly index, at most 256 triggers, at most 256 expiries, the sweep of Params.SweepPositionsPerBlock positions, liquidation through the MarginRatioIndex, deficits and at most 64 ADL counterparties, backstop closes) and moves no token; baseline task 1.3.103 calls it from EndBlock (node/legacyabci/end_block.go:22-28) before EvmKeeper.EndBlock."
ac_2 = "EndBlock logs are ABI-packed by the leaf package precompiles/perps/abi, which modules/perps/keeper imports (the keeper never imports precompiles/perps), and written through the EVMKeeper expected keeper with SetTransientReceipt (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:28-36) on SyntheticReceiptContext(ctx, SyntheticReceiptPerps) as one shell receipt shaped as node/receipt.go:144-153, each log converted with ConvertSyntheticEthLog (modules/evm/keeper/log.go:109-113) and flushed by HandlePreCommit (node/app.go:1279-1281)."
ac_3 = "The receipt tx hash is SyntheticReceiptHash(SyntheticReceiptPerps, height) of baseline task 1.0.6, keccak256 of perps-endblock and the height as 8 big-endian bytes; the receipt is written under SyntheticReceiptContext(ctx, SyntheticReceiptPerps) at the provisional index math.MaxUint32 - 2, and flushTransientReceipts (modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:142) rewrites its TransactionIndex and the TxIndex of its logs to N, the number of transactions of the block (len of txResults, set at node/app.go:2236), so it is the highest real index + 1 and 0 in a block without transactions (baseline req 1.12 ac_3); baseline task 1.0.6 serves it through eth_getLogs, pax_getLogs, eth_getBlockReceipts, eth_getTransactionReceipt and the block bloom."
ac_4 = "A failure in one market's step is isolated in a cached context: that market's writes of the step are dropped, the error is emitted as an event and the chain continues."
ac_5 = "A block with no state to process emits no receipt."

[req.3019]
title = "The v6.9 exchange stays served below activation through the baseline version switch"
ac_1 = "precompiles/layerxexchange stays unchanged: its NewPrecompile (precompiles/layerxexchange/layerxexchange.go:140) is the legacy constructor that baseline task 1.3.100 passes to exchangeVersionSwitch of baseline task 1.2.1 beside precompiles/perps NewPrecompile at node/app.go:961-965; this feature makes no copy under a legacy directory, and the generated layout of precompiles/common/legacy is owned by layerx-merge task 3.7.5, which lands first."
ac_2 = "precompiles/layerxexchange/setup.go gets no GetVersioned entry, precompiles/layerxexchange/versions is unchanged, node/tags gets no line and scripts/bump_version is not run, so the only version mechanism of 0x1015 is the explicit switch of task 1.2.1."
ac_3 = "Calls at heights below activation, and every call while the explicit live flag that the v6.12.0 upgrade handler sets is false, resolve to the v6.9 exchange; from the height the flag is set, 0x1015 serves precompiles/perps, and tracing resolves the version of a traced height through GetCustomPrecompilesVersions (modules/evm/keeper/keeper.go:356-385)."
ac_4 = "The v6.9 call vectors are recorded from the existing precompiles/layerxexchange tests (precompiles/layerxexchange/layerxexchange_test.go) into precompiles/perps/testdata/v69_vectors.json: replayed through the switch with the live flag false they produce the recorded return data and logs, and with the flag true every selector the perps ABI does not declare, pushOracle(bytes,bytes) of platform/hosted/feeder/src/lib.rs:62 and :647 included, reverts with empty data."

[req.3020]
title = "Every perps error is a registered LXP_PERPS code mapped to one parameterless custom error"
ac_1 = "modules/perps/types/errors.go registers each error with sdkerrors.Register(ModuleName, code, LXP_PERPS_<NAME>) on the pattern of modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9, codes 2 to 45 without gaps (44 errors)."
ac_2 = "The precompile maps every keeper error, unwrapped with errors.Is, to its custom error of contracts/perps.md section 19 by code and returns the 4-byte selector as the whole revert data; the 44 selectors are frozen by precompiles/perps/errors_test.go TestErrorsSelectorsFrozen, an internal error without an ABI error packs as Error(string) through RevertReason (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:121-128), and InvalidParams, Unauthorized and InvalidGenesis are keeper-only."
ac_3 = "Every EVM-reachable error of contracts/perps.md section 19 is reachable through the precompile and has a revert test that decodes the revert data with the ABI."

[req.3021]
title = "State is deterministic, exported and checked by invariants"
ac_1 = "Genesis exports and imports every store prefix of contracts/perps.md section 20 and ValidateGenesis refuses duplicate ids, orphan book entries and stale counters with LXP_PERPS_INVALID_GENESIS."
ac_2 = "The invariants of contracts/perps.md section 24 are registered as crisis invariants as the launchpad registers its own (modules/launchpad/keeper/invariants.go:13-20), the solvency identity balanceOf(perps module EVM address) x 1e12 = 1e12 x (sum of collateral, perps_fees and perps_insurance included) - sum of deficits - sum of side x cost basis + sum of side x funding basis + residueUsd checked against StaticCallEVM balanceOf of the USDL ERC20."
ac_3 = "Arithmetic is 256-bit integer with explicit rounding; overflow reverts with PerpsOverflow() and no float type appears in the keeper."
ac_4 = "Two keepers that apply the same scenario produce identical stores and logs; the scenarios cover open, fill, funding, liquidation, backstop and ADL."
ac_5 = "Events alone reconstruct positions and collateral: replaying the logs of a scenario gives every account's collateral and positions."
ac_6 = "LXP_PERPS_OVERFLOW is registered with code 38 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and the precompile maps it to the parameterless custom error PerpsOverflow() (selector 0x927150ed, contracts/perps.md section 19) whose 4-byte selector is the whole revert data when an intermediate fixed-point product exceeds 256 bits."
ac_7 = "LXP_PERPS_INVALID_GENESIS is registered with code 39 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors; it is a keeper-only error with the custom error PerpsInvalidGenesis() (selector 0xd06690f2) declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json for completeness, returned by the keeper when genesis state fails validation."

[req.3022]
title = "Parameters have validated defaults and change only by upgrade handler"
ac_1 = "modules/perps/types/params.go DefaultParams carries the figures of contracts/perps-parameters.md sections 1 to 8 (CollateralToken the USDL ERC20, InsuranceSharePpm 0, ClassEOiCaps, SweepPositionsPerBlock 512, LiquidationScanPerBlock 1,024, default slippage 5,000 ppm), stored as JSON like the launchpad params (modules/launchpad/types/params.go:16, modules/launchpad/keeper/keeper.go:50-60)."
ac_2 = "Params.Validate refuses inverted fee tiers, a maker above taker, negative caps, a ClassEOiCaps table not strictly ascending, a zero CollateralToken and zero bounds with LXP_PERPS_INVALID_PARAMS."
ac_3 = "Keeper.UpdateParams(ctx, authority, params) accepts only the governance authority (modules/launchpad/keeper/keeper.go:76-85) and refuses others with LXP_PERPS_UNAUTHORIZED."
ac_4 = "LXP_PERPS_INVALID_PARAMS is registered with code 2 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors; it is a keeper-only error with the custom error PerpsInvalidParams() (selector 0xc7088a37) declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json for completeness, returned by the keeper when params or a market config fail Validate."
ac_5 = "LXP_PERPS_UNAUTHORIZED is registered with code 35 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors; it is a keeper-only error with the custom error PerpsUnauthorized() (selector 0xf73dc939) declared in precompiles/perps/abi/abi.json for completeness, returned by the keeper when UpdateParams or SetMarket is signed by an account other than the governance module account."

[req.3023]
title = "Domain completion runs the whole perps package set"
ac_1 = "TestPerpsDomainWiring in modules/perps/module_test.go builds the module, the keeper and the precompile together and runs one deposit, order, fill, funding hour and close."
ac_2 = "go test ./modules/perps/... ./precompiles/perps/... passes in one run, and precompiles/layerxexchange is unchanged."
ac_3 = "An EVM transaction sequence in the order the Hyperpax application sends it (USDL approve of 0x1015, createVault, deposit, openPosition, setPositionTpSl, partialClose, closePosition, withdraw) is committed as signed EVM transactions, the form eth_sendRawTransaction delivers, in blocks of a real application (testutil/processblock NewTestApp and RunBlock, testutil/processblock/common.go:36, :72) wired by baseline task 1.3.100; each receipt (GetReceipt, modules/evm/keeper/receipt.go:59) has status 1 and carries the USDL Transfer logs and the events of contracts/perps.md section 18, and the following EndBlock receipt is in the block bloom and is listed by getTxHashesFromBlock (rpc/utils.go:533-553), which baseline task 1.0.6 makes serve eth_getLogs and pax_getLogs."
ac_4 = "The module follows the launchpad module shape: RegisterServices, RegisterInvariants, InitGenesis and ConsensusVersion 1 (modules/launchpad/module.go:98-113, :128)."

[capability_group.3.1]
