do_1 = "Declare IPerps in precompiles/perps/Perps.sol in the style of precompiles/layerxexchange/LayerXExchange.sol with the 67 methods (63 names and the four account overloads getBalance, getLockedBalance, getAccountSummary and getMarginMode), 30 events, 44 custom errors and 11 structs of contracts/perps.md sections 1 and 19."
do_2 = "Embed abi.json with //go:embed in the leaf package precompiles/perps/abi (symbol ABI) as precompiles/launchpad/launchpad.go:94-95 embeds its ABI, parsed with abi.JSON as MustGetABI does (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:449-456), so the package imports no package of this repository and builds with CGO_ENABLED=0."
do_3 = "Keep application selectors of Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePosition.ts:29-121 and Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerpsOrders.ts:10-91 (symbol IPerps)."
do_4 = "Freeze selectors and topics in testdata/abi_golden.txt checked by TestABIGoldenFile, with tuple order from Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:7-42 (symbol OpenPositionQuote)."

