do_2 = "UpdateParams and SetMarket (symbol SetMarket) with the authority check of modules/launchpad/keeper/keeper.go:76-85."
do_3 = "Deposit and Withdraw (symbol Deposit) book the 1e12-scaled amount on the account after the token leg: inside a transaction the precompile runs transferFrom into the perps module EVM address (holder allowance to 0x1015, called from the precompile address) or transfer (called with the perps module EVM address as caller) as a nested call of at most 100,000 gas, as precompiles/xweb/xweb.go:482 calls the EVM, and in module context the keeper uses EVMKeeper.CallEVM (modules/evm/keeper/evm.go:81) from the perps module EVM address; a failed leg reverts with PerpsTokenTransferFailed()."
do_4 = "Settle (symbol Settle) books the realised PnL and funding of a position against its reference price, cost basis and funding basis at every fill, collateral change, liquidation, backstop and ADL step, credits rounded down and debits rounded up into residueUsd."

