ac_12 = "PECOROrders `setOrderFee(uint256 _feeBps)` (0xc014930f, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001022 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:668): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; Params.Validate refuses a stack above MAX_ORDER_FEE_BPS with FeeExceedsMax()."
