[req.4013]
title = "Stop-limit orders activate at the stop and fill inside the limit"
ac_1 = "A stop-limit moves PENDING to ACTIVATED when the index crosses the stop (at or above for a buy, at or below for a sell), then ACTIVATED to EXECUTED inside the limit (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:291-307, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:431-444)."
ac_2 = "An ACTIVATED stop-limit whose index leaves the limit stays ACTIVATED until it returns inside the limit, expires or is cancelled."
ac_3 = "Placement validates prices: a zero stopPrice or limitPrice reverts InvalidPrices() (the source InvalidPrice() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:251); a buy needs limit at or above stop and a sell needs limit at or below stop, else LimitMustBeAboveStopBuy() or LimitMustBeBelowStopSell() (the source InvalidPriceRange() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253)."
ac_4 = "PECORStopOrders `placeStopLimitBuy(address stablecoin, address token, uint256 amount, uint256 stopPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint256 expiresAt) returns (uint256 orderId)` (0xafbf4a9b, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:600): Pulls amount of the stablecoin into escrow (ERC20 by transferFrom against an allowance to this rail, native by bank send) and records a STOP_LIMIT_BUY; a zero price reverts InvalidPrices() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:251); limitPrice below stopPrice reverts LimitMustBeAboveStopBuy() (the ABI name of the source InvalidPriceRange() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253); emits StopLimitOrderCreated (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:204-206, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:246-268)."
ac_5 = "PECORStopOrders `placeStopLimitSell(address token, address stablecoin, uint256 amount, uint256 stopPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint256 expiresAt) returns (uint256 orderId)` (0x5b377378, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:644): Pulls amount of the token into escrow (ERC20 by transferFrom against an allowance to this rail, native by bank send) and records a STOP_LIMIT_SELL; a zero price reverts InvalidPrices() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:251); limitPrice above stopPrice reverts LimitMustBeBelowStopSell() (the ABI name of the source InvalidPriceRange() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253); emits StopLimitOrderCreated (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:208-210, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:246-268)."
ac_6 = "PECORStopOrders `cancelStopLimitOrder(uint256 orderId)` (0x1f407810, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:155): Refunds a PENDING or ACTIVATED stop-limit to its user; NotOrderOwner() for another caller (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:556), CannotCancel() for any other status (the ABI name of the source OrderCannotCancel() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:557); emits StopLimitCancelled (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:274-276, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:548-577)."
ac_7 = "PECORStopOrders `checkStopLimitActivation(uint256 orderId)` (0xabb86ed3, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:181): Activates a pending stop-limit when the index price is at or above stopPrice for a buy and at or below it for a sell; OrderNotPending(), OrderExpired(); emits StopLimitActivated (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:291-307)."
ac_8 = "PECORStopOrders `executeStopLimitOrder(uint256 orderId)` (0xc2063555, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:207): Fills an activated stop-limit when the index price is at or below limitPrice for a buy and at or above it for a sell; NotActivated() (the ABI name of the source OrderNotActivated() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:433), OrderExpired(), PriceAboveLimit() and PriceBelowLimit() (the ABI names of the source PriceNotMet() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:437), InsufficientOutput(), InsufficientLiquidity(); emits StopLimitExecuted (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:284-289, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:431-444)."
ac_9 = "PECORStopOrders `batchCheckAndExecuteStopLimits(uint256[] orderIds) returns (uint256 activatedCount, uint256 executedCount)` (0xbdb82aec, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:112): For each id, activates a pending stop-limit whose stop is crossed, then fills an activated one inside its limit; failures are skipped; returns (activatedCount, executedCount) (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:321-338)."
ac_10 = "The event `StopLimitOrderCreated(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed user, uint8 orderType, uint256 amount, uint256 stopPrice, uint256 limitPrice)` (topic0 0x49fa34ac3a10ddec0a58aa62cf941b37b9cf4a0f50bed03f51b4d5fc63e05df8, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1135) is written at 0x1023 by: placeStopLimitBuy and placeStopLimitSell at 0x1023 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:264)."
ac_11 = "The event `StopLimitActivated(uint256 indexed orderId, uint256 activationPrice)` (topic0 0xc72ba33cc42222338fd43a4280362b9b929d178adfe8f78b2c5bf80fa7cbd6a6, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1084) is written at 0x1023 by: Activation of a stop-limit at 0x1023, activationPrice the index price (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:302)."
ac_12 = "The event `StopLimitExecuted(uint256 indexed orderId, uint256 executionPrice)` (topic0 0x692c4dc9926d7938b6b75f64cc78d24b5e08f43ad0ca442f8cc2dccb3b4d5273, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1116) is written at 0x1023 by: A stop-limit fill at 0x1023 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:442)."
ac_13 = "The event `StopLimitCancelled(uint256 indexed orderId)` (topic0 0x42fdbbee01a2dbf337b473004600b09fe13bf50911fef7df30d522b2e8f90fcc, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1103) is written at 0x1023 by: cancelStopLimitOrder, and expiry of a stop-limit with status EXPIRED, at 0x1023 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:577)."

[req.4014]
title = "Stop-loss orders sell the token when the index falls to the trigger"
ac_1 = "A stop-loss is its own StopLossOrder record (prefix 0x0F) with its own active stop-loss index, placed and served through 0x1023 with its escrow pull made by 0x1023; the source keeps stop-loss orders in the limit record (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:200-202), and the application ABI gives them their own views (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:93, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:418), so no 0x1022 list holds a STOP_LOSS id."
ac_2 = "A stop-loss fills when the index is at or below its trigger, pays the stablecoin net of the maker fee and writes StopLossOrderExecuted at 0x1023."
ac_3 = "Stop-loss expiry refunds the token and writes StopLossOrderCancelled with the record status EXPIRED."
ac_4 = "PECORStopOrders `placeStopLoss(address token, address stablecoin, uint256 tokenAmount, uint256 triggerPrice, uint256 expiresAt) returns (uint256 orderId)` (0x695970ef, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:688): Pulls tokenAmount into escrow (ERC20 by transferFrom against an allowance to this rail, native by bank send) and records a STOP_LOSS order with targetPrice = triggerPrice in the stop-loss record and index of 0x1023; emits StopLossOrderCreated (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:200-202, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:223-244)."
ac_5 = "PECORStopOrders `cancelStopLossOrder(uint256 orderId)` (0xc62bf4dc, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:168): Refunds a pending stop-loss from its own record to its user; NotOrderOwner() for another caller (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:565), NotPending() for any other status, the stop-loss form of the source OrderNotPending() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:566; emits StopLossOrderCancelled (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:565-579)."
ac_6 = "PECORStopOrders `executeStopLossOrder(uint256 orderId)` (0x1a617148, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:220): Fills a pending stop-loss from its own record when the index price is at or below triggerPrice; NotPending() for a final order, OrderExpired(), PriceAboveTrigger() (the ABI name of the source PriceNotMet() of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:417 for a stop-loss), InsufficientOutput(), InsufficientLiquidity(); emits StopLossOrderExecuted at 0x1023 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:410-429)."
ac_7 = "PECORStopOrders `batchExecuteStopLossOrders(uint256[] orderIds) returns (uint256 executedCount)` (0x755f0c0a, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:136): Tries each id as executeStopLossOrder in isolation; returns the number filled (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:310-319)."
ac_8 = "The event `StopLossOrderCreated(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed user, uint256 amount, uint256 triggerPrice)` (topic0 0xb9007dd5be35138b4f9bfc3c734722460cae1a8b97da401020d3ac2762d7655b, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1191) is written at 0x1023 by: placeStopLoss at 0x1023."
ac_9 = "The event `StopLossOrderExecuted(uint256 indexed orderId, uint256 executionPrice)` (topic0 0x029daf69e7abd7c123fcc3c78a61be884c0f62c4e0780faf5de3b66d02b5b8f8, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1222) is written at 0x1023 by: A stop-loss fill from executeStopLossOrder or the batch method in the transaction receipt, or from EndBlock in the spot synthetic receipt, at 0x1023."
ac_10 = "The event `StopLossOrderCancelled(uint256 indexed orderId)` (topic0 0x79403a00e8e6e0c47f9212a62ecd75191e2f197b251c042b5cacf631da0b34c0, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1178) is written at 0x1023 by: cancelStopLossOrder, and expiry of a stop-loss with status EXPIRED, at 0x1023."

[req.4015]
title = "Stop order views read the stored records"
ac_1 = "getActivatableStopLimits and getExecutableStopLimits return at most 100 ids each in active-list order (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrderViews.sol:116-147)."
ac_2 = "The stop-loss views read the StopLossOrder records; an id that is not a stop-loss reads as the zero record."
ac_3 = "nextOrderId at 0x1023 equals nextOrderId at 0x1022 at every height."
ac_4 = "PECORStopOrders `activeStopLimitOrderIds(uint256) returns (uint256)` (0xa68cade3, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:74): Returns the id at position i of the active stop-limit list (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:103, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:657-669)."
ac_5 = "PECORStopOrders `activeStopLossOrderIds(uint256) returns (uint256)` (0x6b8f73c1, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:93): Returns the id at position i of the active stop-loss index of 0x1023, swap-and-pop on removal; stop-loss orders have their own record and index, never in the limit list of 0x1022 (the source keeps them in the limit list, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:200-202)."
ac_6 = "PECORStopOrders `getActivatableStopLimits(uint256 maxCount) returns (uint256[] orderIds)` (0x614a89fa, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:278): Returns up to min(maxCount, 100) pending stop-limit ids whose stop is crossed (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:393-395, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrderViews.sol:116-147)."
ac_7 = "PECORStopOrders `getActiveStopLimitOrderCount() returns (uint256)` (0x61bc56a0, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:297): Returns the length of the active stop-limit list (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:370-372)."
ac_8 = "PECORStopOrders `getActiveStopLossOrderCount() returns (uint256)` (0x7a5c00ac, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:310): Returns the length of the active stop-loss list."
ac_9 = "PECORStopOrders `getExecutableStopLimits(uint256 maxCount) returns (uint256[] orderIds)` (0xbfa1be17, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:323): Returns up to min(maxCount, 100) activated stop-limit ids that can fill now (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:397-399, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrderViews.sol:116-147)."
ac_10 = "PECORStopOrders `getStopLimitOrder(uint256 orderId) returns ((uint256 id, address user, address stablecoin, address token, uint256 amount, uint256 stopPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint8 orderType, uint8 status, uint256 createdAt, uint256 expiresAt))` (0x307ff324, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:342): Returns the StopLimitOrder record (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:346-351, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECOROrders.sol:58-70)."
ac_11 = "PECORStopOrders `getStopLossOrder(uint256 orderId) returns ((uint256 id, address user, address stablecoin, address token, uint256 amount, uint256 triggerPrice, uint8 status, uint256 createdAt, uint256 expiresAt))` (0x4c34cf02, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:418): Returns the STOP_LOSS record projected to (id, user, stablecoin, token, amount, triggerPrice, status, createdAt, expiresAt), triggerPrice being the record's targetPrice (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECOROrders.sol:45-56)."
ac_12 = "PECORStopOrders `getUserStopLimitOrders(address user) returns (uint256[])` (0xe93c4673, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:484): Returns the user's stop-limit ids in placement order (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:360-364)."
ac_13 = "PECORStopOrders `getUserStopLossOrders(address user) returns (uint256[])` (0x21297b41, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:503): Returns the user's stop-loss ids in placement order."
ac_14 = "PECORStopOrders `stopLimitOrders(uint256) returns (uint256 id, address user, address stablecoin, address token, uint256 amount, uint256 stopPrice, uint256 limitPrice, uint8 orderType, uint8 status, uint256 createdAt, uint256 expiresAt)` (0x6d077d13, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:830): Returns the StopLimitOrder fields as a flat tuple (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:98)."
ac_15 = "PECORStopOrders `stopLossOrders(uint256) returns (uint256 id, address user, address stablecoin, address token, uint256 amount, uint256 triggerPrice, uint8 status, uint256 createdAt, uint256 expiresAt)` (0xe9c6b6ae, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:899): Returns the stop-loss projection as a flat tuple."
ac_16 = "PECORStopOrders `userStopLimitOrders(address, uint256) returns (uint256)` (0xa4eca981, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:991): Returns the id at position i of the user's stop-limit list (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:100)."
ac_17 = "PECORStopOrders `userStopLossOrders(address, uint256) returns (uint256)` (0xc68b2481, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001023 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1015): Returns the id at position i of the user's stop-loss list."

[req.4016]
title = "Order errors are the ABI custom errors of the application"
ac_1 = "Each engine error without an ABI entry maps to the ABI error the application decodes, by the mapping table of contracts/spot.md#errors: PriceNotMet becomes PriceAboveTarget or PriceBelowTarget (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:417-418), PriceAboveTrigger on a stop-loss (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:417) and PriceAboveLimit or PriceBelowLimit on a stop-limit fill (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:437); OrderNotActivated becomes NotActivated (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:433); InvalidPrice becomes InvalidPrices (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:251); InvalidPriceRange becomes LimitMustBeAboveStopBuy or LimitMustBeBelowStopSell (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253); OrderCannotCancel and OrderNotPending become CannotCancel (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:557, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:566); NotOrderOwner in collectFees becomes NotFeeCollector (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:517); InvalidPricing becomes the Params.Validate module errors (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:505); TokenQuarantined becomes TokenPaused (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:236) and ReservesMismatch becomes InsufficientLiquidity (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:311)."
ac_2 = "Validation runs before any transfer: a zero amount, an unregistered or paused token, a wrong token class, a past expiry, an escrow value below minOrderNotional or a user at maxActiveOrdersPerUser reverts with nothing pulled."
ac_3 = "The fee collector check on the order rails uses NotFeeCollector() from the ABI in place of the engine NotOrderOwner() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:517)."
ac_4 = "The error `CannotCancel()` (selector 0xfbc03578, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:929) is returned as ABI custom error data when: cancelLimitOrder of an order that is not PENDING, the ABI name of the source OrderNotPending() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:566); cancelStopLimitOrder of a stop-limit that is neither PENDING nor ACTIVATED, the ABI name of the source OrderCannotCancel() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:557)."
ac_5 = "The error `InvalidExpiry()` (selector 0xd36c8500, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:954) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A non-zero expiresAt at or before the block time on placement or modification (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:629-631)."
ac_6 = "The error `InvalidPrice()` (selector 0x00bfc921, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:964) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A zero targetPrice or triggerPrice on placement or modification (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:228)."
ac_7 = "The error `InvalidPrices()` (selector 0x2084e5f6, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1294) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A zero stopPrice or limitPrice on stop-limit placement, the ABI name of the source InvalidPrice() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:251)."
ac_8 = "The error `InvalidVault()` (selector 0xd03a6320, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:974) is returned as ABI custom error data when: An order or swap naming a token that is not registered in the vault."
ac_9 = "The error `LimitMustBeAboveStopBuy()` (selector 0x896a5f19, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1309) is returned as ABI custom error data when: placeStopLimitBuy with limitPrice below stopPrice, the buy form of the source InvalidPriceRange() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253)."
ac_10 = "The error `LimitMustBeBelowStopSell()` (selector 0xba470259, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1314) is returned as ABI custom error data when: placeStopLimitSell with limitPrice above stopPrice, the sell form of the source InvalidPriceRange() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:253)."
ac_11 = "The error `NotActivated()` (selector 0x037c597f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1329) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeStopLimitOrder of a stop-limit that is not ACTIVATED, the ABI name of the source OrderNotActivated() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:433)."
ac_12 = "The error `NotOrderOwner()` (selector 0xf6412b5a, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:999) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Cancel or modify by an address other than the order user (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:556)."
ac_13 = "The error `NotPending()` (selector 0x7dc6505a, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1349) is returned as ABI custom error data when: cancelStopLossOrder or executeStopLossOrder of a stop-loss that is not PENDING."
ac_14 = "The error `OrderExpired()` (selector 0xc56873ba, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:1004) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Execution or activation at or after a non-zero expiresAt (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:413)."
ac_15 = "The error `OrderNotPending()` (selector 0xba254946, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:1009) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeLimitOrder, modifyLimitOrder or checkStopLimitActivation of an order that is not PENDING (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:412)."
ac_16 = "The error `PriceAboveLimit()` (selector 0x6d27d70f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1386) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeStopLimitOrder of a buy with the index price above limitPrice, the buy form of the source PriceNotMet() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:437)."
ac_17 = "The error `PriceAboveTarget()` (selector 0xbcfcc626, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:1036) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeLimitOrder of a limit buy with the index price above targetPrice, the buy form of the source PriceNotMet() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:417)."
ac_18 = "The error `PriceAboveTrigger()` (selector 0x7df2e7d4, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1391) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeStopLossOrder with the index price above triggerPrice, the stop-loss form of the source PriceNotMet() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:417)."
ac_19 = "The error `PriceBelowLimit()` (selector 0xb4d66e0f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1396) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeStopLimitOrder of a sell with the index price below limitPrice, the sell form of the source PriceNotMet() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:437)."
ac_20 = "The error `PriceBelowTarget()` (selector 0xb8673d0c, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:1041) is returned as ABI custom error data when: executeLimitOrder of a limit sell with the index price below targetPrice, the sell form of the source PriceNotMet() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:418)."
ac_21 = "The error `TokenPaused()` (selector 0xe7792495, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:1061) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A deposit, swap or placement on a token whose paused flag is set."
ac_22 = "The served JSON of every address carries the entries of contracts/spot.md#added-error-entries beside the application ABI entries."

[req.4017]
title = "The quoter at 0x1024 quotes every trade path the application uses"
ac_1 = "A QuoteResult carries the 23 fields of the application ABI (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:392) filled from one pricing evaluation; twapOut and twapDeviationBps come from the sample ring."
ac_2 = "A request that cannot be priced returns flags (priceStaleIn, priceStaleOut, sufficientLiquidity false) and never reverts, so the application gate assertTradableQuote decides (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:94)."
ac_3 = "tier is 0, 1 or 2 by the volume thresholds and effectiveFeeBps equals feeBps; the other extras follow contracts/spot.md#pecorquoter-interface: utilizationCapBps is the maxUtilizationBps of the output token, tradeUtilizationBps is gross x 10000 / spendable rounded up, cappedByUtilization is true when tradeUtilizationBps exceeds utilizationCapBps, and sufficientLiquidity is true when not capped and gross is at most spendable."
ac_4 = "PECORQuoter `WETH() returns (address)` (0xad5c4648, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:34): Returns the uhpx native pointer, the PAX token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:62)."
ac_5 = "PECORQuoter `batchQuote((address tokenIn, address tokenOut, uint256 amount, bool isExactIn)[] requests) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction)[] results)` (0x3425eb94, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:47): Returns one QuoteResult per request; tokenIn or tokenOut address(0) maps to the PAX pointer; a request that cannot be priced returns flags, never a revert (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:151-169, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IMetaAGQuoter.sol:32)."
ac_6 = "PECORQuoter `getAllLiquidityInfo() returns (address[] tokens, uint256[] reserves, uint256[] prices, bool[] stale)` (0xe9505c98, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:205): Returns every registered token with available reserves, index price and stale flag (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:191-218)."
ac_7 = "PECORQuoter `getLiquidityInfo(address token) returns (uint256 available, uint256 tokenPrice, bool isStale)` (0x7c0f8456, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:233): Returns available reserves, index price and stale flag of one token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:172-188)."
ac_8 = "PECORQuoter `getTWAP(address token, uint256 period) returns (uint256)` (0x6f8c10a8, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:262): Returns the time-weighted index price over period from the keeper sample ring; TwapWindowInvalid() for a zero period or one longer than the ring covers, StalePrice() for a stale latest sample (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:248-253, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:183-206)."
ac_9 = "PECORQuoter `getTokenPrice(address token) returns (uint256 price, uint256 timestamp, bool isStale)` (0xd02641a0, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:286): Returns (index price, timestamp, stale) of the token from GetPrice; USDL returns (1e18, block time, false) (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:221-233)."
ac_10 = "PECORQuoter `getTokenPrices(address[] tokens) returns (uint256[] prices, uint256[] timestamps, bool[] stale)` (0x45ac924d, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:315): Element-wise getTokenPrice (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:236-245)."
ac_11 = "PECORQuoter `pecor() returns (address)` (0x1c45be83, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:344): Returns 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001021 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:66)."
ac_12 = "PECORQuoter `priceOracle() returns (address)` (0x2630c12f, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:357): Returns 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001020, the pricefeed precompile; every spot price is read from modules/pricefeed GetPrice (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:96)."
ac_13 = "PECORQuoter `quoteExactIn(address tokenIn, address tokenOut, uint256 amountIn) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0x12be4fe0, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:370): Returns the QuoteResult of an exact-input swap (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:99-106, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:271-315)."
ac_14 = "PECORQuoter `quoteExactInNative(address tokenOut, uint256 nativeAmountIn) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0xf6824a51, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:516): quoteExactIn with tokenIn the PAX pointer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:117-123)."
ac_15 = "PECORQuoter `quoteExactInToNative(address tokenIn, uint256 amountIn) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0xd3229fed, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:657): quoteExactIn with tokenOut the PAX pointer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:125-131)."
ac_16 = "PECORQuoter `quoteExactOut(address tokenIn, address tokenOut, uint256 amountOut) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0x7020df95, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:798): Returns the QuoteResult of an exact-output swap; amountIn rounds up (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:108-115, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:348-362)."
ac_17 = "PECORQuoter `quoteMarketBuy(address stablecoin, address token, uint256 stablecoinAmount) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0x6f6ac6a2, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:944): quoteExactIn from the stablecoin to the token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:133-140)."
ac_18 = "PECORQuoter `quoteMarketSell(address token, address stablecoin, uint256 tokenAmount) returns ((uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut, uint256 grossAmountOut, uint256 executionPrice, uint256 spotPriceIn, uint256 spotPriceOut, uint256 feeAmount, uint256 feeBps, bool sufficientLiquidity, uint256 availableLiquidity, uint256 priceTimestampIn, uint256 priceTimestampOut, bool priceStaleIn, bool priceStaleOut, uint256 utilizationCapBps, uint256 tradeUtilizationBps, bool cappedByUtilization, uint256 twapOut, uint256 twapDeviationBps, uint256 effectiveFeeBps, uint256 tier, uint256 priceImpactBps, uint256 priceImpactDeduction) result)` (0x5323412e, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:1090): quoteExactIn from the token to the stablecoin (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/quoter/MetaAGQuoter.sol:142-148)."
ac_19 = "PECORQuoter `setPecor(address _pecor)` (0x63096eb4, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:1236): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; 0x1024 always quotes 0x1021."
ac_20 = "PECORQuoter `vault() returns (address)` (0xfbfa77cf, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001024 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORQuoter.ts:1249): Returns 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:97)."
ac_21 = "The quoter reports the utilization of a trade against the cap of its output token through utilizationCapBps, tradeUtilizationBps, cappedByUtilization and sufficientLiquidity."

[req.4018]
title = "The vault pools liquidity per token and accounts provider shares"
ac_1 = "NAV of a token is its spendable reserves: max(0, min(custody - escrow, book) - reserved), where custody is balanceOf of the module EVM address for an ERC20 token and the module bank balance for a native token, escrow is disjoint from the book and reserved is the swap-rail plus order-rail fee accrual (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:541-550)."
ac_2 = "A first deposit of a token of at most MINIMUM_SHARES 1000 reverts ZeroAmount(); a larger first deposit mints amount - 1000 shares to the depositor and 1000 to the spot module account, which never redeems them; a later deposit mints amount x supply / NAV rounded down, and 0 shares reverts ZeroAmount()."
ac_3 = "withdraw(token, shares) pays shares x NAV / supply rounded down and burns the shares; withdrawNative(amount, to) burns amount x supply / NAV rounded up; a payout above the spendable reserves reverts InsufficientLiquidity()."
ac_4 = "A trade adds its input to the book of the input token and subtracts the net output from the book of the output token, the retained part staying in the book as a reservation (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:295, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:313, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:719-720), and emits ReservesUpdated for each at 0x1025; fees and impact belong to feeCollector, and the profit and loss of trades against the index price fall to share holders through NAV."
ac_5 = "PECORVault `deposit(address token, uint256 amount)` (0x47e7ef24, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:86): Pulls amount of a registered unpaused token from the caller (ERC20 by transferFrom against an allowance to 0x1025, native by bank send), credits the measured receipt to the book and mints shares to the caller by the share rule (MINIMUM_SHARES locked on the first deposit); emits Deposit and the share Transfer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:232-242)."
ac_6 = "PECORVault `depositBatch(address[] tokenList, uint256[] amounts)` (0xb9179d21, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:104): deposit for each pair; different lengths revert InvalidArrayLength() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:246-266)."
ac_7 = "PECORVault `depositNative()` (0xdb6b5246, payable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:122): Payable: credits the attached value as uhpx at value / 1e12 and mints PAX shares by the share rule (MINIMUM_SHARES locked on the first deposit); a value that is not a whole multiple of 1e12 wei reverts UnsupportedInputTransfer(); emits NativeDeposit and the share Transfer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:270-281)."
ac_8 = "PECORVault `withdraw(address token, uint256 shares) returns (uint256 amount)` (0xf3fef3a3, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:760): Burns shares of the caller and pays amount = shares x NAV / supply of the token, rounded down, NAV being the spendable reserves (Vault share accounting); ZeroAmount() for zero shares or a zero payout; InsufficientLiquidity() above the spendable reserves; pays by ERC20 transfer or bank send by the token kind; emits LPWithdrawal, Withdrawal and the share Transfer."
ac_9 = "PECORVault `withdrawNative(uint256 amount, address to)` (0xb8ca8dd8, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:784): Burns the PAX shares worth amount, amount x supply / NAV rounded up, from the caller and pays amount as uhpx to to by bank send; emits NativeWithdrawal and the share Transfer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:320-339)."
ac_10 = "PECORVault `syncReserves(address token)` (0xfacdfb5e, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:649): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) for every EVM caller, as the source restricts it to DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:211-215); MsgSyncReserves signed by the governance authority sets the book to custody minus escrow and emits ReservesSync with the recovered amount, 0 for a deficit (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:464-482)."
ac_11 = "PECORVault `syncAllReserves()` (0x78743ca5, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:642): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) for every EVM caller, as the source restricts it to DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:218-228); governance reconciles every registered token through MsgSyncReserves."
ac_12 = "PECORVault `receive() external payable` ((no selector), payable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:23): A plain value transfer to 0x1025 reverts WethOnly(); native liquidity enters through depositNative (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:442-444)."
ac_13 = "The event `Deposit(address indexed token, address indexed depositor, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xdcbc1c05240f31ff3ad067ef1ee35ce4997762752e3a095284754544f4c709d7, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:802) is written at 0x1025 by: deposit and depositBatch at 0x1025, newReserve the book after the credit (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:232-242)."
ac_14 = "The event `LPWithdrawal(address indexed token, address indexed provider, uint256 shares, uint256 amount)` (topic0 0xbacc4c5632df305652cdf9d17913383ae2857b949b623a2ce7b3537458bd0075, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:833) is written at 0x1025 by: withdraw at 0x1025, shares burned and amount paid."
ac_15 = "The event `NativeDeposit(address indexed depositor, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0x2d45cf213b0878e6582a0bddc676c202f8f57ed3cd74e8ccf8955ce1359bd427, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:864) is written at 0x1025 by: depositNative at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:270-281)."
ac_16 = "The event `NativeWithdrawal(address indexed recipient, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0x4c556479041161db341af3dc4010b53fa70282739dc38d464ff9628ee9c9d29f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:889) is written at 0x1025 by: withdrawNative at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:320-339)."
ac_17 = "The event `ReservesSync(address indexed token, uint256 oldReserves, uint256 newReserves, uint256 recovered)` (topic0 0x055fb2ac115b8a1258ed74cd751869f95f1fb10b2c889147acbaca28ba479e5f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:952) is written at 0x1025 by: syncReserves and syncAllReserves at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:464-482)."
ac_18 = "The event `ReservesUpdated(address indexed token, uint256 oldReserve, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xa2c850dc6f3f3d2193ff68281de055559c5468fc0c89311bca2d25f8e50a38f5, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:983) is written at 0x1025 by: Every settlement that changes the book of a token at 0x1025 (deposit, withdraw, trade, fill, MsgSyncReserves): oldReserve and newReserve of that token; EndBlock fills write it in the spot synthetic receipt."
ac_19 = "The event `Withdrawal(address indexed token, address indexed recipient, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xc2b4a290c20fb28939d29f102514fbffd2b73c059ffba8b78250c94161d5fcc6, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1103) is written at 0x1025 by: withdraw and fee collection payouts at 0x1025, newReserve the book after the debit."
ac_20 = "The error `InvalidArrayLength()` (selector 0x9d89020a, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:51) is returned as ABI custom error data when: depositBatch with arrays of different lengths (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:246-266)."
ac_21 = "The error `WethOnly()` (selector 0xcfab6517, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:56) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A plain value transfer to 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:442-444)."
ac_22 = "The error `TokenNotRegistered()` (selector 0x259ba1ad, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:53) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A vault call naming an unregistered token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:355-364)."
ac_23 = "With supply above zero and NAV 0, deposit and depositNative revert InsufficientLiquidity()."
ac_24 = "A donation sent straight to custody raises no NAV until MsgSyncReserves reconciles it, because spendable takes the minimum of custody minus escrow and book."

[req.4019]
title = "Vault views and administration"
ac_1 = "authorizedOperators returns true only for 0x1021, 0x1022 and 0x1023; the operator methods pullTokens, pushTokens and updateReserves are internal keeper calls and refuse every EVM caller."
ac_2 = "Token registration, stablecoin status, token pause and utilization caps change only through the tokens parameter; each change emits TokenRegistered, TokenPauseUpdated or UtilizationCapUpdated at 0x1025."
ac_3 = "getAllReserves and getRegisteredTokens list tokens in registration order: USDL, PAX, SID."
ac_4 = "PECORVault `BPS_DENOMINATOR() returns (uint256)` (0xe1a45218, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:28): Returns 10000 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:61)."
ac_5 = "PECORVault `DEFAULT_MAX_UTILIZATION_BPS() returns (uint256)` (0xfc2a3957, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:41): Returns 10000, the utilization cap of a token without its own cap. The cap is defined by this contract; the source liquidity check has none (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:396-398)."
ac_6 = "PECORVault `WETH() returns (address)` (0xad5c4648, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:54): Returns the ERC20 native pointer of uhpx registered by InitV6120, the PAX token of the venue; the engine kept a wrapped token here (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:101), which the bank model replaces."
ac_7 = "PECORVault `authorizedOperators(address) returns (bool)` (0x181d989b, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:67): Returns true for 0x1021, 0x1022 and 0x1023, false for every other address (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:81)."
ac_8 = "PECORVault `emergencyWithdraw(address token, uint256 amount, address recipient)` (0x551512de, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:129): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; liquidity leaves the vault only through withdraw, withdrawNative, swaps, fills and fee collection (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:191-208)."
ac_9 = "PECORVault `getAllReserves() returns (address[], uint256[])` (0x6aa701bf, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:152): Returns every registered token with its book reserves (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:416-430)."
ac_10 = "PECORVault `getRegisteredStablecoins() returns (address[])` (0x8790e479, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:170): Returns the registered stablecoins in registration order (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:406-409)."
ac_11 = "PECORVault `getRegisteredTokenCount() returns (uint256)` (0x5c549d81, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:183): Returns the number of registered tokens (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:411-414)."
ac_12 = "PECORVault `getRegisteredTokens() returns (address[])` (0x14cbd993, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:196): Returns the registered tokens in registration order (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:401-404)."
ac_13 = "PECORVault `getReserves(address token) returns (uint256)` (0x3e99c1e4, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:209): Returns the book reserves of the token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:355-364)."
ac_14 = "PECORVault `getTokenDecimals(address token) returns (uint8)` (0x785c7cf6, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:228): Returns the decimals recorded at registration (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:391-394)."
ac_15 = "PECORVault `getTokenInfo(address token) returns (bool isRegistered, bool isStablecoin_, uint8 decimals, uint256 reserves, uint256 totalDeposited, uint256 totalWithdrawn)` (0x1f69565f, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:247): Returns isRegistered, isStablecoin, decimals, reserves, totalDeposited and totalWithdrawn (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:366-383, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECORVault.sol:18)."
ac_16 = "PECORVault `getUntrackedFunds(address token) returns (uint256)` (0xb73954da, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:291): Returns custody minus escrow minus the book reserves, 0 when negative, where custody is balanceOf of the module EVM address for an ERC20 token and the module bank balance for a native token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:433-437)."
ac_17 = "PECORVault `hasLiquidity(address token, uint256 amount) returns (bool)` (0xf19476e2, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:310): Returns true when the token is registered and not paused, amount is at most the spendable reserves (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:396-398, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:541-550) and amount x 10000 is at most spendable x maxUtilizationBps; the utilization cap is defined by this contract."
ac_18 = "PECORVault `isStablecoin(address token) returns (bool)` (0x1a650cc7, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:334): Returns the stablecoin flag (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:386-389)."
ac_19 = "PECORVault `isTokenPaused(address token) returns (bool)` (0x5e76ad54, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:353): Returns the paused flag of the token; a paused token refuses deposits, swaps and placements with TokenPaused()."
ac_20 = "PECORVault `maxUtilizationBps(address) returns (uint256)` (0x965611eb, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:372): Returns the token cap in bps, DEFAULT_MAX_UTILIZATION_BPS when unset; the cap is defined by this contract and has no source counterpart."
ac_21 = "PECORVault `owner() returns (address)` (0x8da5cb5b, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:391): Returns the EVM address of the governance module account, the only authority over spot parameters (modules/launchpad/keeper/keeper.go:76-86 pattern)."
ac_22 = "PECORVault `pausedTokens(address) returns (bool)` (0xee7a4596, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:404): Same value as isTokenPaused(token)."
ac_23 = "PECORVault `pullTokens(address token, address from, uint256 amount) returns (uint256)` (0xac85dca7, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:423): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) for every EVM caller; the rails pull in-process through the keeper (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:284-298)."
ac_24 = "PECORVault `pushTokens(address token, address to, uint256 amount)` (0xa6c29ca3, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:452): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) for every EVM caller; the rails pay in-process through the keeper (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:301-317)."
ac_25 = "PECORVault `registerToken(address token, bool _isStablecoin)` (0x6710b83f, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:475): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; tokens register through the tokens parameter and InitV6120 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:121-143)."
ac_26 = "PECORVault `registeredStablecoins(uint256) returns (address)` (0xe4c20a3f, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:493): Returns the stablecoin at position i (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:85)."
ac_27 = "PECORVault `registeredTokens(uint256) returns (address)` (0x9a0ba2ea, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:512): Returns the token at position i (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:84)."
ac_28 = "PECORVault `renounceOwnership()` (0x715018a6, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:531): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams."
ac_29 = "PECORVault `setMaxUtilizationBps(address token, uint256 capBps)` (0x07e31551, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:538): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; a change emits UtilizationCapUpdated."
ac_30 = "PECORVault `setOperator(address operator, bool authorized)` (0x558a7297, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:556): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:168-180)."
ac_31 = "PECORVault `setStablecoinStatus(address token, bool _isStablecoin)` (0x72a4acb8, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:574): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:146-165)."
ac_32 = "PECORVault `setTokenPaused(address token, bool paused)` (0x62257470, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:592): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; a change emits TokenPauseUpdated."
ac_33 = "PECORVault `setTransactionTracker(address _tracker)` (0xd25a18e5, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:610): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; no tracker is configured (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:180)."
ac_34 = "PECORVault `shareTokens(address) returns (address)` (0x96153f07, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:623): Returns the ERC20 pointer of the token share denom, created at registration."
ac_35 = "PECORVault `tokens(address) returns (bool isRegistered, bool isStablecoin, uint8 decimals, uint256 reserves, uint256 totalDeposited, uint256 totalWithdrawn)` (0xe4860339, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:662): Returns the TokenInfo fields as a flat tuple (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:83)."
ac_36 = "PECORVault `transactionTracker() returns (address)` (0xa4cf2f1c, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:706): Returns the zero address; trade records are the logs of this contract (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:98)."
ac_37 = "PECORVault `transferOwnership(address newOwner)` (0xf2fde38b, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:719): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams."
ac_38 = "PECORVault `updateReserves(address tokenIn, uint256 amountIn, address tokenOut, uint256 amountOut)` (0x11948d22, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:732): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller); book changes happen only through settlement (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:342-352)."
ac_39 = "The event `OperatorUpdated(address indexed operator, bool authorized)` (topic0 0x966c160e1c4dbc7df8d69af4ace01e9297c3cf016397b7914971f2fbfa32672d, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:914) is written at 0x1025 by: Three times at activation by InitV6120 for 0x1021, 0x1022 and 0x1023 with authorized true (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:168-180)."
ac_40 = "The event `ShareTokenCreated(address indexed token, address indexed shareToken)` (topic0 0x6f64ce3fea7909e3e9ebc85ea8450670af3fe5d23143325c4f1ebd38c5343256, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1008) is written at 0x1025 by: Registration of a token at 0x1025, shareToken the pointer address."
ac_41 = "The event `TokenPauseUpdated(address indexed token, bool paused)` (topic0 0x253b2f7aa4de4ccf23ab8e9c2078ab1cc589649293d26006ecdf802a5d6b451d, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1027) is written at 0x1025 by: A parameter change of the paused flag of a token at 0x1025."
ac_42 = "The event `TokenRegistered(address indexed token, uint8 decimals, bool isStablecoin)` (topic0 0x3247537f6efe5e5d3f25242f42522e1bfbabeea906fc7005a128b11bcdb3f99b, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1046) is written at 0x1025 by: Registration of a token at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:121-143)."
ac_43 = "The event `TransactionTrackerUpdated(address indexed tracker)` (topic0 0x3dd2b7e16ddea78bec31b5b95991ba3d03fda27bc5c8a8441775b76c8f88033e, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1071) is written at 0x1025 by: Once at activation at 0x1025 with tracker address(0)."
ac_44 = "The event `UtilizationCapUpdated(address indexed token, uint256 maxUtilizationBps)` (topic0 0xbcfb6f6e36e3fb105ffb3042d755b572cec796e9c4c634f0bb7ef3c8967331ac, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1084) is written at 0x1025 by: At activation for each registered token and on a parameter change of its cap, at 0x1025."
ac_45 = "The error `TokenAlreadyRegistered()` (selector 0x7d4fffb2, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:52) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Params.Validate for a token listed twice (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:121-143)."
ac_46 = "The error `UnsupportedToken()` (selector 0x6a172882, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:57) is returned as ABI custom error data when: InitV6120 or a parameter change registering an ERC20 token whose decimals() fails or exceeds 36 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:499-509), a NATIVE token that is not the native pointer of a bank denom with metadata, or a token whose decimals differ from the pinned 6 of an opening token."
ac_47 = "MsgSyncReserves signed by the governance authority runs the reconciliation of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:464-482 over custody - escrow for each listed token and emits ReservesSync(token, onBook, balance, delta) at 0x1025; any other signer fails."

[req.4020]
title = "Vault share tokens are bank denoms with ERC20 pointers"
ac_1 = "Each registered token has the share denom spot/share/<token address> with metadata name \"Spot Vault Share <symbol>\", symbol \"s<symbol>\" and the token decimals, and an ERC20 native pointer created by UpsertERCNativePointer (modules/evm/keeper/pointer_upgrade.go:49-57) whose code is NativePaxTokensERC20 (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:7)."
ac_2 = "Shares are minted and burned only by the vault keeper in transactions (deposit, depositBatch, depositNative, withdraw, withdrawNative) through the bank module, with the spot module account holding Minter and Burner scoped to spot/share/* (baseline task 1.3.100), so totalSupply of the pointer equals the bank supply of the denom (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:41-43); because a bank mint never runs the pointer _update, each mint and burn writes the share Transfer log at the pointer through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16)."
ac_3 = "Shares are transferable ERC20 balances: a holder who receives shares by transfer can withdraw them."
ac_4 = "PECORVaultShare `allowance(address owner, address spender) returns (uint256)` (0xdd62ed3e, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:34): Served by the ERC20 native pointer of the share denom (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:7)."
ac_5 = "PECORVaultShare `approve(address spender, uint256 value) returns (bool)` (0x095ea7b3, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:58): Served by the share pointer (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:7)."
ac_6 = "PECORVaultShare `balanceOf(address account) returns (uint256)` (0x70a08231, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:82): Returns the bank balance of the share denom (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:33-35)."
ac_7 = "PECORVaultShare `decimals() returns (uint8)` (0x313ce567, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:119): Returns the decimals of the underlying token (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:37-39)."
ac_8 = "PECORVaultShare `name() returns (string)` (0x06fdde03, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:150): Returns \"Spot Vault Share <symbol>\" from the denom metadata (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:25-27)."
ac_9 = "PECORVaultShare `symbol() returns (string)` (0x95d89b41, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:183): Returns \"s<symbol>\", for example sUSDL (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:29-31)."
ac_10 = "PECORVaultShare `totalSupply() returns (uint256)` (0x18160ddd, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:196): Returns the bank supply of the share denom (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:41-43)."
ac_11 = "PECORVaultShare `transfer(address to, uint256 value) returns (bool)` (0xa9059cbb, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:209): Moves shares through the bank precompile; emits Transfer (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:45); a value above the balance fails with Error(string) \"NativePaxTokensERC20: transfer failed\"."
ac_12 = "PECORVaultShare `transferFrom(address from, address to, uint256 value) returns (bool)` (0x23b872dd, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:233): Moves shares under allowance; emits Transfer (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:45); a value above the allowance reverts ERC20InsufficientAllowance and a value above the balance fails with Error(string) \"NativePaxTokensERC20: transfer failed\"."
ac_13 = "PECORVaultShare `mint(address to, uint256 amount)` (0x40c10f19, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:132): Not served: the pointer has no such selector and the call reverts; shares are minted only by the spot keeper on deposit, through the bank Minter permission scoped to spot/share/*, and each mint emits Transfer(address(0), holder, shares) at the share pointer."
ac_14 = "PECORVaultShare `burn(address from, uint256 amount)` (0x9dc29fac, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:101): Not served: shares are burned only by the spot keeper on withdraw, through the bank Burner permission scoped to spot/share/*, and each burn emits Transfer(holder, address(0), shares) at the share pointer."
ac_15 = "PECORVaultShare `owner() returns (address)` (0x8da5cb5b, view) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:163): Not served: the share pointer has no `owner()` selector."
ac_16 = "PECORVaultShare `renounceOwnership()` (0x715018a6, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:176): Not served by the share pointer."
ac_17 = "PECORVaultShare `transferOwnership(address newOwner)` (0xf2fde38b, nonpayable) is served at each vault share pointer returned by `shareTokens(address)` with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:262): Not served by the share pointer."
ac_18 = "The event `Approval(address indexed owner, address indexed spender, uint256 value)` (topic0 0x8c5be1e5ebec7d5bd14f71427d1e84f3dd0314c0f7b2291e5b200ac8c7c3b925, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:275) is written at share pointer by: The share pointer on approve (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:7); the rails never emit it, an ERC20 allowance being granted by the user on the token contract."
ac_19 = "The event `Transfer(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 value)` (topic0 0xddf252ad1be2c89b69c2b068fc378daa952ba7f163c4a11628f55a4df523b3ef, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:319) is written at share pointer by: The share pointer on transfer and transferFrom (contracts/src/NativePaxTokensERC20.sol:45); on keeper mint (from address(0)) and burn (to address(0)) of shares the spot keeper writes a synthetic Transfer at the share pointer address through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16), in the deposit or withdraw transaction."
ac_20 = "The error `ERC20InsufficientAllowance(address spender, uint256 allowance, uint256 needed)` (selector 0xfb8f41b2, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:344) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Share transferFrom above the allowance, from the share pointer."
ac_21 = "The error `ERC20InsufficientBalance(address sender, uint256 balance, uint256 needed)` (selector 0xe450d38c, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:365) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Never produced: the share pointer fails a transfer above the balance with Error(string) \"NativePaxTokensERC20: transfer failed\"; the entry stays in the ABI."
ac_22 = "The error `ERC20InvalidApprover(address approver)` (selector 0xe602df05, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:386) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Share approve from address(0), from the share pointer."
ac_23 = "The error `ERC20InvalidReceiver(address receiver)` (selector 0xec442f05, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:397) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Share transfer to address(0), from the share pointer."
ac_24 = "The error `ERC20InvalidSender(address sender)` (selector 0x96c6fd1e, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:408) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Share transfer from address(0), from the share pointer."
ac_25 = "The error `ERC20InvalidSpender(address spender)` (selector 0x94280d62, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVaultShare.ts:419) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Share approve to address(0), from the share pointer."
ac_26 = "The keeper refuses to mint or burn any denom outside spot/share/*."

[req.4021]
title = "TWAP is kept from index samples in the spot keeper"
ac_1 = "EndBlock records one (block time, index price) sample per registered non-stable token into a ring of 1000 samples per token."
ac_2 = "getTWAP(token, period) is the time-weighted mean of the samples inside the window ending at the block time, following PriceOracle getTWAP (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:183-206); a zero period or one longer than the ring covers reverts TwapWindowInvalid() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:187)."
ac_3 = "While twapSanityEnabled, a swap whose index deviates from the TWAP over twapSanityPeriod by more than maxTwapDeviationBps reverts StalePrice(); twapSanityEnabled is false at activation."
ac_4 = "The error `TwapWindowInvalid()` (selector 0xb307c2d2, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:62) is returned as ABI custom error data when: getTWAP with a zero period or one longer than the sample ring covers (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:187)."
ac_5 = "The error `InvalidTWAPPeriod()` (selector 0x8bd931d1, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:969) is returned as ABI custom error data when: Params.Validate when fillQualityTwapPeriod or twapSanityPeriod exceeds twapMaxPeriod."

[req.4022]
title = "InitV6120 activates the spot venue with the opening pairs"
ac_1 = "modules/spot/keeper/init_v6120.go func InitV6120(ctx sdk.Context, k Keeper) error is the spot hook of the v6.12.0 handler; the hook table of baseline task 1.3.100 runs createV6120Pointers of baseline task 1.2.4 (node/upgrades_v6120_pointers.go), launchpad MigrateV6120, pricefeed InitV6120, perps SeedV6120 and spot InitV6120 in that order, then sets the v6120Live flag."
ac_2 = "It registers USDL as stable with kind ERC20 at contracts/libraries/Constants.sol:14, reading decimals() through StaticCallEVM and requiring the pinned 6 (contracts/libraries/Constants.sol:16), and uhpx (modules/evm/keeper/params.go:22) with kind NATIVE and market 11 and the SID denom layerxbridgetypes.SidioraDenom() (modules/layerxbridge/types/keys.go:53-59) with kind NATIVE and market 12 at their native pointers, reading each native decimals from the denom metadata exponent as the pointer precompile does (precompiles/pointer/pointer.go:107-124) and requiring the pinned 6, so the opening pairs are PAX/USDL and SID/USDL."
ac_3 = "It creates each share denom, metadata and pointer, writes the default parameters, and writes the activation logs into the activation synthetic receipt of baseline task 1.0.6 (SyntheticReceiptActivation, TransactionIndex the highest real index + 3): OwnershipTransferred(address(0), governance) at 0x1021, 0x1022, 0x1023 and 0x1025 only, never at a share pointer, OperatorUpdated for the three rails, TokenRegistered, ShareTokenCreated and UtilizationCapUpdated per token and TransactionTrackerUpdated(address(0))."
ac_4 = "A native pointer that is absent, metadata that is absent or decimals other than 6 return an error that aborts the plan before any spot state is written; the pointers are created by createV6120Pointers of baseline task 1.2.4, which runs first."
ac_5 = "Running InitV6120 a second time returns an error and changes nothing, because the params key is already set."
ac_6 = "InitV6120 refuses a native denom whose metadata exponent is not the pinned 6."

[req.4023]
title = "Gas is a fixed row per method"
ac_1 = "Each method is charged from its row of a GasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:64-65) set by WithGasTable (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:115), in the shape of the launchpad formula base + per byte + per write (precompiles/launchpad/launchpad.go:224-226)."
ac_2 = "A method without a row is refused instead of charged a default, so every served selector has a row."
ac_3 = "The bank moves, nested ERC20 calls and store writes of a method are charged through the gas meter of the context and the call gas on top of the row, converted as precompiles convert Cosmos gas (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:187-216); EndBlock work, its CallEVM legs included, runs at gas price zero, is charged to no account and is bounded by the EndBlock budgets."

[req.4024]
title = "Reverts carry ABI custom error data and every state change emits a log"
ac_1 = "A failed call returns the 4-byte selector of the ABI error, from the application ABI or contracts/spot.md#added-error-entries, followed by its ABI-encoded arguments, not Error(string) (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:121-128); precompiles/spot runs its own Run that reuses Prepare (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:227) and writes the custom error data before returning vm.ErrExecutionReverted (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:187-216)."
ac_2 = "Each log of a transaction is written through EmitEVMLog (precompiles/common/evm_events.go:16) at the address of the rail that changed state, with indexed fields as topics in ABI order; EndBlock logs go to the spot synthetic receipt and activation logs to the activation synthetic receipt of baseline task 1.0.6."
ac_3 = "A call that reverts writes no log."

[req.4025]
title = "The Hyperpax call sequence runs unchanged against the precompile set"
ac_1 = "The market path: allowance and approve of USDL to 0x1021, the rail that pulls it (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotApprovals.ts:54, Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotApprovals.ts:75), quoteMarketBuy at 0x1024 (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotQuoter.ts:139-142), then marketBuy at 0x1021 with the quote minus slippage as minimum (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:151-167)."
ac_2 = "The limit path: approve of USDL to 0x1022, placeLimitBuy (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:297-300), getUserLimitOrders and getLimitOrder (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:369-382), modifyLimitOrder (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:357-360) and cancelLimitOrder (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:343-346)."
ac_3 = "The stop path: approve of the input to 0x1023 when it is USDL, placeStopLimitBuy (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:425-428), placeStopLoss (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:517-520) and the stop views (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:540-572)."
ac_4 = "The PAX path: PAX and SID need no allowance, so the application skips the approve step for them (feature 6); marketSell of the uhpx pointer at 0x1021 (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:254-257) sells from the native balance, the PAX constant of the application being the uhpx pointer with 6 decimals; the wrap step before it (Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotOrders.ts:222-229) is removed by feature 6, because the uhpx pointer has no `deposit()`."

[req.4026]
title = "The spot venue keeps its accounting invariants"
ac_1 = "For every registered token, custody (balanceOf of the module EVM address for an ERC20 token, the module bank balance for a native token) is at least book reserves plus escrow, and book reserves are at least the fee accruals; the spot-solvency invariant checks it as launchpad registers its own (modules/launchpad/keeper/invariants.go:10-40)."
ac_2 = "For every token, the bank supply of its share denom is zero exactly when its pool never took a deposit and is at least MINIMUM_SHARES after the first, so no share is left without backing."
ac_3 = "Every active index holds only orders of its kind in PENDING (or ACTIVATED for stop-limits) status, every escrow equals the sum of amounts of its active orders, and the active count of each user equals the number of their active orders."
ac_4 = "Every trade and fill adds amountIn to the book of its input token and removes the net output from the book of its output token, and the USD value at the index of amountIn equals the USD value of gross within the rounding of gross; the conservation invariant checks it."
ac_5 = "The genesis Validate of the module refuses an active index entry without its record, an escrow that differs from the sum of its active orders and an active count that differs from the active orders of its user."

[req.4027]
title = "The spot domain passes its package test set once"
ac_1 = "go test ./modules/spot/... ./precompiles/spot/... runs once against the domain tree and exits 0."
ac_2 = "The module default genesis validates and round-trips through InitGenesis and ExportGenesis as launchpad does (modules/launchpad/keeper/genesis.go:11, modules/launchpad/keeper/genesis.go:53)."
ac_3 = "The completion task 4.3.99 is required by the baseline wiring task 1.3.100."

