do_1 = "Add LimitOrder, StopLimitOrder and StopLossOrder in modules/spot/types/orders.go with the fields and order of the application tuples (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECOROrders.sol:45-70, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:418 for the stop-loss tuple), the orderMinOutput of each order (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOROrders.sol:113), and OrderType LIMIT_BUY, LIMIT_SELL, STOP_LOSS, STOP_LIMIT_BUY, STOP_LIMIT_SELL (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECOROrders.sol:14-20)."
do_2 = "OrderStatus is PENDING 0, ACTIVATED 1, EXECUTED 2, CANCELLED 3, EXPIRED 4, matching Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/interfaces/IPECOROrders.sol:22-28."
do_3 = "Add AbiError in modules/spot/types/errors.go: a Go error carrying the 4-byte selector and packed arguments of each error of contracts/spot.md#errors, OrderBelowMinimumNotional() and TooManyActiveOrders() included, registered next to sdkerrors codes as launchpad registers its errors (modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:11-34)."
do_4 = "Add FillBackoff (failure count, next-retry height), the EndBlock cursors and the per-user active count, and GenesisState carrying every prefix of contracts/spot.md#storage, with DefaultGenesis and Validate in the shape of modules/launchpad/types/genesis.go:56-72."
do_5 = "Validate refuses an active index entry without its record, an escrow that differs from the sum of its active orders and an active count that differs from the active orders of its user; TestGenesisValidate in modules/spot/types/genesis_test.go covers each refusal and that DefaultGenesis validates."

