do_3 = "CheckTwapSanity compares the index with TWAP over twapSanityPeriod and returns StalePrice (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/oracle/PriceOracle.sol:161) above maxTwapDeviationBps while twapSanityEnabled."
