do_2 = "Register USDL as stable with kind ERC20 at contracts/libraries/Constants.sol:14, reading decimals() through StaticCallEVM and requiring the pinned 6 (contracts/libraries/Constants.sol:16), and uhpx (modules/evm/keeper/params.go:22) with kind NATIVE and market 11 and the SID denom layerxbridgetypes.SidioraDenom() (modules/layerxbridge/types/keys.go:53-59) with kind NATIVE and market 12 at their native pointers, reading decimals from the denom metadata as precompiles/pointer/pointer.go:107-124 and requiring 6; an absent pointer, absent metadata or other decimals return an error before any spot state is written."
