do_5 = "The hook runs after createV6120Pointers (baseline task 1.2.4), launchpad MigrateV6120, pricefeed InitV6120 and perps SeedV6120 in the hook table of baseline task 1.3.100; the init tests cover the order, the opening pairs, the logs, the absent pointer, TestInitV6120RefusesWrongDecimals and the second run."

