do_1 = "Add EndBlocker(ctx, k) in modules/spot/abci.go in the shape of modules/oracle/abci.go:152-169, to be called from node/legacyabci/end_block.go:22-28 by the baseline wiring task 1.3.100."
do_2 = "ExecuteResting runs the bounded steps of contracts/spot.md#endblock-execution: one TWAP sample per non-stable token, at most maxExpiriesPerBlock expiries from the expiry index, an activation scan of at most activationScanPerBlock and a fill scan of at most fillScanPerBlock entries with at most maxFillsPerBlock fills, both from persisted cursors that wrap, each fill in a cached context (modules/launchpad/keeper/swap.go:129 shape)."
do_3 = "A failed fill writes only its back-off record, next-retry height = height + min(2^failures, maxFillBackoffBlocks); ERC20 payouts run through CallEVM from the module address (modules/evm/keeper/evm.go:81) and native payouts by bank send, the same keeper path as a transaction."
do_4 = "The EndBlocker runs under SyntheticReceiptContext(ctx, SyntheticReceiptSpot) of baseline task 1.0.6; the CallEVM logs merge into that receipt (modules/evm/keeper/evm.go:130-153) and the spot logs are appended to it, in the legacy end block order oracle, perps, spot, EVM of baseline task 1.3.103."
