ac_6 = "The non-null fields of Hyperpax:src/core/perps/perpetual.graphql that the gateway has no source for become nullable and every reader handles null: PoolState.baseReserve and quoteReserve, MarkPriceRecord.baseReserve and quoteReserve, SpotMarket.marketId, baseToken, quoteToken, mode and status, SpotOrder.side, offsetBps, size, filledSize and marketId, SpotOrderFill.fillScore, LatestPrice.onchainTimestamp, Market.maxLeverage, Trade.isLong, Trade.tradeType staying String! with the lowercase names that contracts/data-services.md section 13 maps from the contracts/perps.md numbering, and the FeeConfig fields; contracts/data-services.md section 13 is the authority for every other field."

