ac_1 = "classifyError (Hyperpax:src/core/errors/classify.ts:266) decodes the typed custom error from revert data with decodeErrorResult over the perps and spot ABIs before the string rules at :239-255."
ac_2 = "`InsufficientLiquidity` (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECOROrders.ts:949) maps to TRADE_INSUFFICIENT_LIQUIDITY and InsufficientOutput, PriceAboveTarget and PriceBelowTarget (:1036, :1041) to TRADE_SLIPPAGE_EXCEEDED."
ac_3 = "Expired (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:77) maps to RPC_REVERT with the deadline message and LimitMustBeAboveStopBuy and LimitMustBeBelowStopSell (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORStopOrders.ts:1309, :1314) to TRADE_TP_SL_INVALID."
ac_4 = "Each custom error of contracts/perps.md#19-errors maps to one code of PRECOMPILE_ERROR_CODES, and undecodable revert data keeps the RPC_REVERT path (Hyperpax:src/core/errors/classify.ts:153-160)."
ac_5 = "Every custom error contracts/spot.md lists (Expired, SameToken, StalePrice, `InsufficientLiquidity`, InsufficientOutput, ZeroAmount, NativeTransferFailed, MulticallFailed, UseWethDeposit, UseWethWithdraw, WethOnly, UnsupportedTransfer, UnsupportedInputTransfer and the rest of that list) and every error of contracts/perps.md#19-errors has an entry, and an error without an entry fails the classifier test."

[req.6019]
title = "The application completes the trading round trip against a local node"
ac_1 = "tests/e2e-local-node.test.ts (planned) approves exactly 100 USDL to 0x1015 on the USDL token, deposits it and reads getAccount(account).collateral back."
ac_2 = "It opens a 20x market long on market 0 with TP and SL through placeOrder, reads them back through getPositionDetails, places and cancels a limit order and adds 10 USDL collateral after the exact allowance step."
ac_3 = "It partially closes half the size and closes the rest through closePositionWithParams with price bounds."
ac_4 = "It reads a funding payment for the account through the gateway GetFundingPayments operation (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useSubgraph.ts:291)."
ac_5 = "It withdraws getAccount(account).withdrawable and the USDL balance arithmetic matches to the base unit net of the fees in the receipts' events."
ac_6 = "It never skips: an unset LOCAL_NODE_RPC, LOCAL_NODE_KEY or NEXT_PUBLIC_PERPS_GATEWAY_URL fails the test with the variable name."
ac_7 = "It asserts that SPOT_TOKENS.PAX.address equals WETH() of 0x1024, that decimals() of the PAX and SID pointers is 6, and quotes a 25 USDL market buy of PAX at 0x1024."

[req.6020]
title = "Spot tokens are USDL and the uhpx and SID denom pointers, and the spot markets are the opening pairs"
ac_1 = "SPOT_TOKENS (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/addresses.ts:88-155) holds USDL, PAX (the uhpx pointer, 6 decimals) and SID (the SID denom pointer, 6 decimals); the WPAX9, WETH, WBNB, USDC and USDT entries (:98-105, :114-145) are removed."
ac_2 = "SPOT_STABLECOIN_LIST (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/addresses.ts:167-171) holds USDL only, and selectStableForBuy and selectStableForSell (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/stableSelector.ts:78, :119) return USDL."
ac_3 = "SPOT_MARKETS (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/config.ts:59-84) holds PAX/USDL and SID/USDL, the opening pairs of contracts/spot.md, and DEFAULT_SPOT_SYMBOL (:116) stays SID."
ac_4 = "Hyperpax:src/core/spot/native.ts with WPAX9_ADDRESS (:68), computeWrapShortfall (:94), computeUnwrapAmount (:130) and shouldWrapBeforeSell (:155) is deleted, and the PAX balance of the spot form (Hyperpax:src/widgets/spot/SpotOrderForm.tsx:392-403) is the pointer balanceOf at 6 decimals."
ac_5 = "A market's baseDecimals and baseAddress (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/config.ts:37-58) come from the token entry, so a 1 PAX sell encodes 1000000 base units."
ac_6 = "The unused Diamond-era spot tables of the perpetuals configuration, SPOT_TOKENS and SPOT_MARKETS_META (Hyperpax:src/core/perps/config.ts:89-141), are removed."

[req.6021]
