ac_1 = "Chart candles, the useQuoter ticker and open interest, the ticker prices of useRealtimePrices (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useRealtimePrices.ts:3, :56), the network health probe (Hyperpax:src/widgets/network-pill/NetworkPill.tsx:18, :38), the reference book and trades streams (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useSidPaxMarketStream.ts:50-52, :69-70; Hyperpax:src/hooks/spot/useSpotMarketStream.ts:23-25, :34) and the markets stream (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useMarketsStream.ts:22-24, :29) read Chainflow through FEED_ORIGIN or MARKET_DATA_URL (Hyperpax:src/core/feeds.ts:2-3)."
