do_2 = "Copy ReplayRunner and Run (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/replay.go:34, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/replay.go:151) with the batch loop of Backfill (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/backfill.go:8, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/backfill.go:20) as replay.Runner, origin Launch-x core/indexer/internal/processor (contracts/data-services.md section 7)."
do_3 = "cmd/perps-replay takes --from and --to heights (to defaults to the cursor), takes the writer lease so the indexer pauses, deletes facts and projections in [from, to], re-reads the logs, the synthetic receipts and block_results over PERPS_COMET_URLS from the node, rewrites them through store.WriteBlock and releases the lease; --dry-run reports the row counts that would change (contracts/data-services.md section 7)."
do_4 = "Replayed messages reuse the event ids of the first write, so JetStream deduplicates the ones still inside the duplicate window and consumers deduplicate older ones through delivery_inbox (Launch-x:shared/delivery/schema.sql:35) (contracts/data-services.md section 7)."
do_5 = "Add TestReplay with subtests validates_range, refuses_from_above_cursor, rewrites_identical_rows, dry_run_counts and holds_lease against PERPS_DATA_TEST_RPC and PERPS_DATA_TEST_DATABASE_URL (contracts/data-services.md section 7)."

