do_2 = "Add the control frames welcome, subscribed, unsubscribed, pong and error with ts and snapshotId (Hyperpax:data_api.md:44-50) and DataFrame with topic, ts, snapshotId, seq, snapshot and data (Hyperpax:data_api.md:59-68); snapshot is omitted on live frames (contracts/data-services.md section 8)."
do_3 = "Add Limits with 200 subscriptions per socket and 50 subscribe operations per second (Hyperpax:data_api.md:88) and a 30 second server ping (Hyperpax:data_api.md:86); a socket that answers no ping within two intervals is closed (contracts/data-services.md section 8)."
do_4 = "When the gateway sheds load it closes with code 1013 and the reason retry-after=<seconds>, which the application client parses (Hyperpax:src/core/net/realtime.ts:84-85), with a jittered value between 5 and 30 seconds (contracts/data-services.md section 8)."
