verification_contract = "go test -count=1 ./platform/perps-data/internal/graphql/ -run 'TestPerpsResolvers'"
do_1 = "Add one resolver per perpetuals query root from position to orderlyOpenInterests (Hyperpax:src/core/perps/perpetual.graphql:571, Hyperpax:src/core/perps/perpetual.graphql:754) plus leaderboard, each reading the source and following the field mapping of the root table of contracts/data-services.md section 13: trades from trade_settlements, orders from perps.orders with failureReason null, latestPrices and markPriceHistory from mark_prices, priceHistory from index_prices of kind aggregate, userVault from perps.vaults and account_margin, vaultEvents from collateral_events, collateralTokens the constant USDL row, poolStates with reserves 0, feeConfig from perps.fee_config, keeperCycles from keeper_cycles, accountLedger from the account_ledger view, oiSnapshots from open_interest, vaultBalanceHistory from collateral_events and insurance_events, delegates an empty list."
do_2 = "limit defaults to 50 and is clamped to [1, 500]; offset is clamped to [0, 100000]; addresses compare in lower case; an unknown id answers null for single roots and an empty list for list roots (contracts/data-services.md section 13)."
do_3 = "Position.market and Market.latestPrice are resolved with one batched query per request, not per row, so GetPositions with market { symbol } costs two queries (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useSubgraph.ts:23) (contracts/data-services.md section 13)."
do_4 = "The orderly roots are served from the venue projections in the Orderly-shaped types; enrichedGlobalStats and enrichedMarketStats carry the on-chain values only (contracts/data-services.md section 13)."
do_5 = "Add TestPerpsResolvers with one subtest per perpetuals query root, including leaderboard, against PERPS_DATA_TEST_DATABASE_URL seeded through store.WriteBlock (contracts/data-services.md section 13)."

