do_2 = "spotMarket and spotMarkets read the non-stablecoin tokens of perps.spot_token_registry (PAX and SID) with marketId the token, quoteToken USDL, mode 0 and status from Paused, Unpaused and TokenPauseUpdated; spotOrder and spotOrders read perps.spot_orders with side 0 buy and 1 sell, size the amount, filledSize the amount when executed and offsetBps 0 (contracts/data-services.md section 13)."
