do_2 = "The gateway also mounts the venue routes of contracts/data-services.md section 24 under both /api and /api/markets (/api/orderbook/<SYMBOL>, /api/open-interest, /api/ticker/<SYMBOL> and /api/markets/tickers, Hyperpax:src/widgets/trading/Orderbook.tsx:148, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:54, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:82, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useRealtimePrices.ts:56), /v1/users/<address>/... and /v1/leaderboards/<kind> (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/api.ts:283, Hyperpax:src/core/spot/api.ts:361), the spot user socket /v1/ws, and /v2/auth/*, /v2/user, /v2/leaderboard, /v2/alerts, /v2/referrals and /v2/competitions (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerfdbAuth.ts:168); the data socket also answers on / as the data protocol names (Hyperpax:data_api.md:27). Fixed route names take precedence over the /api/<symbol>/ and /api/markets/<symbol> patterns."
do_3 = "The rate limiter (Launch-x:core/api/internal/ratelimit/ratelimit.go:49) bounds REST and GraphQL per client key (Launch-x:core/api/internal/ratelimit/ratelimit.go:25); route cache classes follow RoutePolicy (Launch-x:core/api/internal/cache/policy.go:29) (contracts/data-services.md section 19)."
do_4 = "Readiness is true when Postgres answers, the JetStream consumer is attached and the newest applied message is at most 10 seconds behind the stream head; while not ready new sockets are closed with 1013 and a retry-after reason (contracts/data-services.md section 19)."
do_5 = "Metrics: perps_gateway_sockets, perps_gateway_subscriptions, perps_gateway_frames_total by topic family, perps_gateway_resyncs_total, perps_gateway_graphql_duration_seconds by operation and perps_http_requests_total by route and status (contracts/data-services.md section 19)."
do_6 = "Add TestGatewayServer with subtests rest_mounted, graphql_mounted, ws_mounted, socket_paths_autosubscribe, graphql_ws_mounted, readiness_gate and close_1013_when_not_ready (contracts/data-services.md section 19)."

