do_6 = "Add TestNATSDriver with subtests publish_ack, refuses_foreign_stream, refuses_zero_sequence, dedup_msg_id and consumer_fetch against an in-process nats-server/v2 with JetStream enabled, so the pinned modules are compiled and exercised by the task gate."
