do_1 = "Write migrations/0001_facts.sql creating schema perps with the common fact columns of contracts/data-services.md section 2 (row_id, block, block_hash, tx_index, log_index, sub, tx_hash, receipt_kind, block_time, emitter, kind, account, tx_from), every fact table of that section, perps.raw_logs, perps.protocol_events and perps.tx_actions; each fact table has primary key (block, tx_index, log_index, sub) and unique indexes (tx_hash, log_index, sub) and (row_id), extending the swap key of Launch-x:core/indexer/migrations/00001_init.sql:202 with sub so CollateralTransferred and other multi-row events keep every row."
do_2 = "receipt_kind carries a CHECK on tx, perps_endblock, spot_endblock, activation and block_event, and a CHECK keeps tx_from null for every receipt kind other than tx; the signed columns named in section 6 carry CHECK (x >= -2^255 AND x < 2^255) and unsigned columns CHECK (x >= 0)."
do_3 = "0001_facts.sql also creates the chain tables perps.blocks (number, hash, parent_hash, time, proposer as the upper-case hex of the CometBFT header ProposerAddress, tx_count) with the fields of BlockRecord (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/source/committed.go:64), perps.cursors in the shape of the launchpad cursor table (Launch-x:core/indexer/migrations/00001_init.sql:13), perps.writer_lease, perps.markets and perps.fee_config, the last two keyed market_id with a unique symbol and id 1."
do_4 = "Write migrations/0002_projections.sql with positions_current, orders, spot_orders, account_margin, user_stats, user_pnl_daily, market_stats_rolling, leaderboard, spot_token_seen, market_snapshots, protocol_snapshots and keeper_cycles in the columns and keys of section 2, and the view perps.account_ledger over collateral_events, fees, funding_payments and trade_settlements; no candle table and no oi_snapshots table exist, open interest history being read from perps.open_interest."
do_5 = "Every amount column is numeric(78,0) holding the raw uint256 or int256 value of the log, refused by a CHECK when it has a fraction, so no scaling happens before the gateway; every account column is bytea of length 20."
do_6 = "Add migrations/embed.go declaring the package migrations with //go:embed *.sql into FS, so internal/store applies the files in lexical order."
