do_1 = "Copy Event, Decoder, NewDecoder, Decode, unpackArgs and humanize (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:31, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:43, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:49, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:58, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:82, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/decode.go:165) with exactArgs and boundedValue (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/scalars.go:14, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/scalars.go:82) and DeduplicateRaw (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/dedup.go:17) into internal/decode/registry.go, origin Launch-x core/indexer/internal/decode."
do_2 = "Registry, NewRegistry and Registry.Decode (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:149, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:158, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:322) key decoders by (address, topic0); a log of a venue address with an unknown topic0 is written to perps.raw_logs with decoded false and counted in perps_indexer_unknown_logs_total, never dropped."
do_3 = "perps.go registers the 30 events at 0x1015 of the decoding table of contracts/data-services.md section 6, the events contracts/perps.md section 18 lists as emitted, from the leaf ABI package precompiles/perps/abi of the same commit; no decoder exists for the events of contracts/perps.md section 25 that the release does not emit or for BorrowingFeeAccrued, whose logs go to raw_logs with failure_class unknown_topic."
do_4 = "Each decoder returns a typed row (TradeSettledRow, FillRow and so on) whose unsigned amount fields are decimal strings checked by bigint.ValidateRaw and whose signed fields (grossPnl, fundingPaidUsd, realizedPnl, makerFeeUsd, fundingRate, longPayment, shortPayment, newRatePerSecond, fundingRate24h, fundingPaymentUsd) by bigint.ValidateRawInt256; CollateralTransferred yields two rows, transferred_out with sub 0 and account from and transferred_in with sub 1 and account to."
do_5 = "The account column takes the argument named in section 6, the user of the earlier placed or opened row of the same id (from the rows of the same batch, else perps.order_events and perps.position_events) for events that carry only an id, and the venue module address otherwise; tx_from is the sender only for receipt_kind tx and never supplies the account, unlike the txFrom input of Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/processor.go:337."
do_6 = "tradeType decodes as 0 open, 1 close, 2 liquidation, 3 reduce, 4 increase, 5 adl, 6 backstop and feeType as 0 trading, 4 maker rebate, the numbering of contracts/perps.md section 2; feeType 1 to 3 is never emitted, and a value outside its enumeration (feeType 1 to 3 included) is stored as emitted and counted in perps_indexer_enum_unknown_total."
do_7 = "Add TestPerpsDecoders with one subtest per event of the 30 rows; each packs the arguments with the leaf ABI (abi.Arguments.Pack and abi.MakeTopics), decodes the resulting ethtypes.Log and asserts every column of the fact row, plus subtests unknown_topic, duplicate_log, account_rule, signed_columns, enum_unknown and not_emitted_events."
do_8 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
