do_2 = "Add publish.Publisher.Run looping delivery.Relay.RunOnce (Launch-x:shared/delivery/relay.go:27) over the outbox in Perps-Seq order; the event_id is <chain>:<block>:<block_hash>:<tx_index>:<log_index>:<sub> with the lower-case block hash and is the Nats-Msg-Id (Launch-x:shared/delivery/natsdriver/driver.go:45), so a republish inside the duplicate window is acknowledged without a second stream entry and a log of a rewritten height is a new event."
