do_1 = "The perpetual book aggregates the perps.orders rows with status active, a non-zero limit_price and remaining_size_usd above 0 per market and limit_price, bids from is_long orders and asks from the others, each level summing remaining_size_usd, from orders and the OrderPlaced, OrderOptions, Fill, OrderCancelled and OrderExpired deltas; snapshots carry up to 100 levels per side, asks ascending and bids descending (Hyperpax:data_api.md:214, Hyperpax:data_api.md:341)."
do_2 = "Live book frames are coalesced to at most 10 per second per topic and carry the top 20 levels per side; every 5 seconds a frame carries checksum, the CRC32 (IEEE) of the top 20 levels written as price:size pairs joined by commas, asks then bids."
do_3 = "topics.go registers <SYMBOL>@perp_orderbook, @perp_trade (one frame per Fill), @perp_stats and @market for every market, <SYMBOL>@orderbook, @trade and @stats for PAX and SID only (the book from the open spot_orders of the token, bids from buy and asks from sell orders at target_price; trades from spot_swaps and executed spot orders), markets@all, markets@totals, chain@blocks (snapshot of 20) and chain@transactions (snapshot of 50), with the payloads of Hyperpax:data_api.md:234, Hyperpax:data_api.md:287, Hyperpax:data_api.md:364, Hyperpax:data_api.md:388, Hyperpax:data_api.md:498, Hyperpax:data_api.md:513, Hyperpax:data_api.md:534, Hyperpax:data_api.md:611 and Hyperpax:data_api.md:647."
do_4 = "No kline topic exists and candles stay on the Chainflow feed (contracts/data-services.md section 12); a subscribe to <SYMBOL>@kline_<interval>, to a spot topic of a symbol other than PAX and SID or to an unknown symbol answers the error unknown_topic. The socket paths /ws/<symbol>, /ws/markets and /ws/explorer subscribe on open to the topics of the symbol, to markets@all and markets@totals, and to chain@blocks and chain@transactions."
do_5 = "Stats and market providers broadcast every 30 seconds and every 5 seconds respectively and on subscribe; @market broadcasts only while it has a subscriber."
do_6 = "Add TestFeeds with one subtest per topic family plus book_ordering, book_rate_limit, book_checksum, perp_trade_once_per_fill, spot_unknown_symbol, unknown_symbol_topic, no_kline_topic, symbol_socket_autosubscribe and explorer_socket."
do_7 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
