do_1 = "transportws.go serves /graphql-ws with the graphql-transport-ws subprotocol (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useIndexerSubscriptions.ts:5): connection_init and connection_ack within 10 seconds, subscribe, next, error, complete, ping and pong; one socket multiplexes many subscriptions."
