do_1 = "Create tools/spec/check_resolutions.py with load(path) reading spec/<feature>/spec.kvx under the section, key and quoted-list rules of tools/specgen/kvx.go:45-84 (parse) and tools/specgen/kvx.go:228-244 (splitList), so a list value parses as the Go reader parses it."
do_2 = "Add known_ids(doc) returning the ids of every [task.*] and [capability.*] section, and resolve(ref, ids) that accepts an exact id or a wildcard <prefix>.* matching at least one id; the clause rule of tools/specgen/validate.go:132-148 stays as it is for the repository linter."
do_3 = "Add check(doc) that reports resolution.<id>: unknown <ref> for every unresolved applies_to id, resolution.<id>: applies to no task when none of its ids is a task, and decision.<N>: no resolution when no source equals decision D<N>, then exits 1 when any line was printed and 0 otherwise."
do_4 = "Accept --feature <slug> to pick spec/<slug>/spec.kvx in place of the active feature that tools/specgen/main.go:57 reads from workflow.kvx, and print one summary line resolutions <n> decisions <m> unresolved <k>."
do_5 = "Create tools/spec/check_resolutions_test.py with test_unknown_id_fails, test_wildcard_needs_a_match, test_decision_without_resolution_fails and test_release_feature_passes over small kvx strings and the real spec/release-v6-12-0/spec.kvx."
do_6 = "Add applies(doc, root) behind the flag --applies: for each resolution in id order it takes the first task of its applies_to, runs that task's verify_cmd once from the repository root as one command (shlex split, no shell), and prints resolution.<id>: gate <task> exit <code> for a nonzero exit; the source check of check(doc) also prints resolution.<id>: no heading <anchor> when a contract source names a heading absent from its file under contracts/ or docs/."
do_7 = "In tools/spec/check_resolutions_test.py add test_decision_<N>_resolved for N = 1 to 11, test_rule_<name>_resolved for each cross-feature rule (usdl, paxsid, markets, v1015, order, logs, fees, spotset, feedkey, inputs, nosol, gate, errors, accounts, wiring), test_resolution_9_<k>_applies for k = 1 to 69 over the applies(doc, root) record of a run with --applies, and test_address_table_rows over contracts/address-table.md and contracts/README.md, each the test its acceptance of req 9.1 names."
do_8 = "Finish the entire scoped implementation first; then format touched files, run one build and verify_cmd once, at most two task-scoped repair cycles; record unrelated findings once in qualification.kvx without expanding scope."
